lprofiles'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_socialprofiles\");' >Social Media Profile Finder&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_sorbs'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_sorbs\");' >SORBS</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_soroush'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_soroush\");' >Soroush Monitor</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_spamcop'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_spamcop\");' >SpamCop</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_spamhaus'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_spamhaus\");' >Spamhaus Zen</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_spider'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_spider\");' >Web Spider</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_spur'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_spur\");' >spur.us&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_sslcert'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_sslcert\");' >SSL Certificate Analyzer</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_stackoverflow'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_stackoverflow\");' >StackOverflow&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_stevenblack_hosts'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_stevenblack_hosts\");' >Steven Black Hosts</a></li>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_surbl'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_surbl\");' >SURBL</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_talosintel'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_talosintel\");' >Talos Intelligence</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_telegram'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_telegram\");' >Telegram Channel Monitor</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_textmagic'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_textmagic\");' >TextMagic&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_threatcrowd'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_threatcrowd\");' >ThreatCrowd</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_threatfox'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_threatfox\");' >ThreatFox</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_threatminer'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_threatminer\");' >ThreatMiner</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tiktok_osint'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tiktok_osint\");' >TikTok OSINT Intelligence&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tldsearch'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tldsearch\");' >TLD Searcher</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_cmseek'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_cmseek\");' >Tool - CMSeeK</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_dnstwist'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_dnstwist\");' >Tool - DNSTwist</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_gobuster'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_gobuster\");' >Tools - Gobuster</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_nbtscan'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_nbtscan\");' >Tool - nbtscan</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_nmap'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_nmap\");' >Tool - Nmap</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_nuclei'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_nuclei\");' >Tool - Nuclei</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_onesixtyone'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_onesixtyone\");' >Tool - onesixtyone</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_phoneinfoga'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_phoneinfoga\");' >Tools - PhoneInfoga&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_retirejs'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_retirejs\");' >Tool - Retire.js</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_snallygaster'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_snallygaster\");' >Tool - snallygaster</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_testsslsh'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_testsslsh\");' >Tool - testssl.sh</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_trufflehog'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_trufflehog\");' >Tool - TruffleHog</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_wafw00f'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_wafw00f\");' >Tool - WAFW00F</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_wappalyzer'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_wappalyzer\");' >Tool - Wappalyzer (API)&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tool_whatweb'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tool_whatweb\");' >Tool - WhatWeb</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_torch'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_torch\");' >TORCH</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_torexits'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_torexits\");' >TOR Exit Nodes</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_tron'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_tron\");' >Tron Blockchain Monitor&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_twilio'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_twilio\");' >Twilio&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_uceprotect'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_uceprotect\");' >UCEPROTECT</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_unwiredlabs'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_unwiredlabs\");' >UnwiredLabs Geolocation API&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_urlscan'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_urlscan\");' >URLScan.io</a></li>\n    \n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_viewdns'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_viewdns\");' >ViewDNS.info&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_virustotal'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_virustotal\");' >VirusTotal&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_voipbl'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_voipbl\");' >VoIP Blacklist (VoIPBL)</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_vxvault'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_vxvault\");' >VXVault.net</a></li>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_wechat'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_wechat\");' >WeChat Monitor&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_whatcms'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_whatcms\");' >WhatCMS&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_whatsapp'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_whatsapp\");' >WhatsApp Monitor&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_whoisfreaks'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_whoisfreaks\");' >WhoisFreaks&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_whoisology'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_whoisology\");' >Whoisology&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_whoxy'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_whoxy\");' >Whoxy&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_wificafespots'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_wificafespots\");' >WiFiCafeSpots.com Lookup</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_wifimapio'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_wifimapio\");' >WiFiMap.io Lookup</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_wigle'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_wigle\");' >WiGLE&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_wikileaks'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_wikileaks\");' >Wikileaks</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_wikipediaedits'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_wikipediaedits\");' >Wikipedia Edits</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_xforce'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_xforce\");' >XForce Exchange&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_xiaohongshu'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_xiaohongshu\");' >Xiaohongshu (Little Red Book) Monitor</a></li>\n    \n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_zetalytics'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_zetalytics\");' >Zetalytics&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_zonefiles'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_zonefiles\");' >ZoneFile.io&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_zoneh'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_zoneh\");' >Zone-H Defacement Check</a></li>\n    \n        \n        \n        \n        <li id='tab_sfp_zoomeye'><a href='#' onclick='switchTab(\"sfp_zoomeye\");' >ZoomEye&nbsp;&nbsp;<i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-lock\"></i></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tab-content col-md-9\">\n\n<div id='optsect_global' class=\"tab-pane active\">\n<h4>Global Settings</h4>\n<table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n<thead><tr> <th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n    <tr><td>Enable debugging?</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        \n            <select id='_debug' class='form-control'>\n                <option value=1 >True</option>\n                <option value=0 selected>False</option>            </select>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Override the default resolver with another DNS server. For example, 8.8.8.8 is Google's open DNS server.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_dnsserver' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Number of seconds before giving up on a HTTP request.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_fetchtimeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"5\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>List of usernames that if found as usernames or as part of e-mail addresses, should be treated differently to non-generics.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_genericusers' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"webmaster,list-request,privacy,security,ftp,registry,billing,phishing,dns,null,root,hostmaster,inoc,list,marketing,peering,sales,undisclosed-recipients,support,ispfeedback,no-reply,peering-notify,compliance,noreply,rr,tech,unsubscribe,abuse,phish,spam,registrar,postmaster,www,admin,devnull,ispsupport,usenet,noc,uucp,routing-registry,sysadmin,peering-request,maildaemon\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>List of Internet TLDs.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_internettlds' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"https://publicsuffix.org/list/effective_tld_names.dat\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Hours to cache the Internet TLD list. This can safely be quite a long time given that the list doesn't change too often.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_internettlds_cache' class='form-control' type=text value=\"72\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>No description available</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_logging' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"INFO\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Max number of modules to run concurrently</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_maxthreads' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Modules enabled for the scan.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_modulesenabled' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>SOCKS Server Type. Can be '4', '5', 'HTTP' or 'TOR'</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_socks1type' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>SOCKS Server IP Address.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_socks2addr' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>SOCKS Server TCP Port. Usually 1080 for 4/5, 8080 for HTTP and 9050 for TOR.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_socks3port' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>SOCKS Username. Valid only for SOCKS4 and SOCKS5 servers.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_socks4user' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>SOCKS Password. Valid only for SOCKS5 servers.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_socks5pwd' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n    <tr><td>User-Agent string to use for HTTP requests. Prefix with an '@' to randomly select the User Agent from a file containing user agent strings for each request, e.g. @C:\\useragents.txt or @/home/bob/useragents.txt. Or supply a URL to load the list from there.</td><td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n        <div class='form-group'>\n            <input id='_useragent' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:62.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/62.0\">\n        </div>\n    </td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_4chan' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>4chan Monitor (sfp_4chan)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>\n    SpiderFoot plugin to monitor 4chan boards for new posts and emit events.\n    <br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of 4chan board names.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_4chan:boards' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of threads to fetch per board.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_4chan:max_threads' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp__ai_threat_intel' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>AI Threat Intelligence Engine (sfp__ai_threat_intel)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>AI-Powered Threat Intelligence Engine.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>enterprise, ai, ml</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Threshold for anomaly detection (0.0-1.0)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum correlation strength for IOC relationships\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable automated IOC correlation\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__ai_threat_intel:enable_ioc_correlation' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable natural language processing for threat analysis\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__ai_threat_intel:enable_nlp_analysis' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable AI-powered attack pattern recognition\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__ai_threat_intel:enable_pattern_recognition' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable predictive threat analytics\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__ai_threat_intel:enable_predictive_analytics' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable dynamic ML-based threat scoring\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__ai_threat_intel:enable_threat_scoring' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Interval for ML model updates (seconds)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__ai_threat_intel:ml_model_update_interval' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3600\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Time horizon for threat predictions (hours)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__ai_threat_intel:prediction_time_horizon' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum threat score to trigger alerts (0-100)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__ai_threat_intel:threat_score_threshold' class='form-control' type=text value=\"70\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp__security_hardening' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Security Hardening Engine (sfp__security_hardening)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Advanced Security Hardening Module.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>enterprise, security</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Days to retain audit logs\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__security_hardening:audit_retention_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"90\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable comprehensive security audit logging\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__security_hardening:enable_audit_logging' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable end-to-end encryption for sensitive data\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__security_hardening:enable_encryption' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable multi-factor authentication\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__security_hardening:enable_mfa' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable role-based access control\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__security_hardening:enable_rbac' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable zero-trust architecture\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__security_hardening:enable_zero_trust' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Days between encryption key rotations\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__security_hardening:encryption_key_rotation_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum failed authentication attempts before lockout\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__security_hardening:max_failed_attempts' class='form-control' type=text value=\"5\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Session timeout in seconds\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__security_hardening:session_timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3600\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Threshold for suspicious activity detection\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__security_hardening:suspicious_activity_threshold' class='form-control' type=text value=\"5\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp__stor_db' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Database Storage (sfp__stor_db)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plug-in for storing events to the configured database\n    backend.\n\n    This class is responsible for storing scan results into the back-end\n    SpiderFoot database (SQLite or PostgreSQL).\n    <br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable metrics collection (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:collect_metrics' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Database type to use (sqlite or postgresql)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db:db_type' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"sqlite\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable automatic error recovery (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_auto_recovery' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable auto scaling (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_auto_scaling' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable connection health monitoring (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_connection_monitoring' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable connection pooling (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_connection_pooling' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable graceful shutdown procedures (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_graceful_shutdown' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable health monitoring (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_health_monitoring' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable load balancing (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_load_balancing' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable performance benchmarking (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_performance_benchmarking' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable performance monitoring (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_performance_monitoring' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable query optimization (enterprise feature)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db:enable_query_optimization' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum bytes to store for any piece of information retrieved (0 = unlimited.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db:maxstorage' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1024\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>PostgreSQL database name if using postgresql as db_type\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db:postgresql_database' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"spiderfoot\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>PostgreSQL host if using postgresql as db_type\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db:postgresql_host' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"localhost\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>PostgreSQL password if using postgresql as db_type\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db:postgresql_password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>PostgreSQL port if using postgresql as db_type\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db:postgresql_port' class='form-control' type=text value=\"5432\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Connection timeout in seconds for PostgreSQL\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db:postgresql_timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>PostgreSQL username if using postgresql as db_type\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db:postgresql_username' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"spiderfoot\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp__stor_db_advanced' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Advanced Database Storage (Enterprise) (sfp__stor_db_advanced)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Advanced enterprise storage module Advanced features.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>enterprise, production</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of events to batch before bulk insert\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:bulk_insert_threshold' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Initial size of connection pools\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:connection_pool_size' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>List of database configurations for load balancing\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:database_configs' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\" placeholder=\"Enter comma-separated values\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable automatic scaling of database connections\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:enable_auto_scaling' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable connection load balancing across multiple databases\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:enable_load_balancing' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable real-time performance monitoring\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:enable_performance_monitoring' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable AI-powered query optimization\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:enable_query_optimization' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of connection pools\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:max_connection_pools' class='form-control' type=text value=\"5\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum bytes to store for any piece of information retrieved (0 = unlimited.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_db_advanced:maxstorage' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1024\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp__stor_elasticsearch' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ElasticSearch Storage (sfp__stor_elasticsearch)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plug-in for storing events to an ElasticSearch instance.\n\n    This module sends scan results to an external ElasticSearch instance\n    for storage and analysis.\n    <br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>ElasticSearch API key (if using API key authentication)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of events to bulk insert at once\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:bulk_size' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable storing events to ElasticSearch\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:enabled' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>ElasticSearch host\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:host' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"localhost\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>ElasticSearch index name\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:index' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"spiderfoot\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>ElasticSearch password (if using authentication)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>ElasticSearch port\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:port' class='form-control' type=text value=\"9200\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Connection timeout in seconds\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Use SSL for the connection\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:use_ssl' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>ElasticSearch username (if using authentication)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:username' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify SSL certificates\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp__stor_elasticsearch:verify_certs' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp__stor_stdout' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Command-line output (sfp__stor_stdout)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_abstractapi' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>AbstractAPI (sfp_abstractapi)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Look up domain, phone and IP address information from AbstractAPI.<br/><br/>Abstract provides powerful APIs to help you enrich any user experience or automate any workflow.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://app.abstractapi.com/\" target=_new>https://app.abstractapi.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>AbstractAPI Company Enrichment API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://app.abstractapi.com/users/signup'>https://app.abstractapi.com/users/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://app.abstractapi.com/api/'>https://app.abstractapi.com/api/</a></li><li>Visit each API page and click on 'Try it out'</li><li>Your API Key will be listed under 'This is your private API key, specific to this API.'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_abstractapi:companyenrichment_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>AbstractAPI IP Geolocation API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://app.abstractapi.com/users/signup'>https://app.abstractapi.com/users/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://app.abstractapi.com/api/'>https://app.abstractapi.com/api/</a></li><li>Visit each API page and click on 'Try it out'</li><li>Your API Key will be listed under 'This is your private API key, specific to this API.'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_abstractapi:ipgeolocation_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>AbstractAPI Phone Validation API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://app.abstractapi.com/users/signup'>https://app.abstractapi.com/users/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://app.abstractapi.com/api/'>https://app.abstractapi.com/api/</a></li><li>Visit each API page and click on 'Try it out'</li><li>Your API Key will be listed under 'This is your private API key, specific to this API.'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_abstractapi:phonevalidation_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_abusech' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>abuse.ch (sfp_abusech)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a host/domain, IP address or netblock is malicious according to Abuse.ch.<br/><br/>abuse.ch is operated by a random swiss guy fighting malware for non-profit, running a couple of projects helping internet service providers and network operators protecting their infrastructure from malware.\nIT-Security researchers, vendors and law enforcement agencies rely on data from abuse.ch,trying to make the internet a safer place.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.abuse.ch\" target=_new>https://www.abuse.ch</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable abuse.ch Feodo IP check?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_abusech:abusefeodoip' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable abuse.ch SSL Backlist IP check?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_abusech:abusesslblip' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable abuse.ch URLhaus check?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_abusech:abuseurlhaus' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_abusech:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_abusech:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_abusech:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_abusech:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_abusech:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_abuseipdb' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>AbuseIPDB (sfp_abuseipdb)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if an IP address is malicious according to AbuseIPDB.com.<br/><br/>AbuseIPDB is a project dedicated to helping combat the spread of hackers,spammers, and abusive activity on the internet.\nOur mission is to help make Web safer by providing a central blacklist forwebmasters, system administrators, and other interested parties toreport and find IP addresses that have been associated with malicious activity online.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.abuseipdb.com\" target=_new>https://www.abuseipdb.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>AbuseIPDB.com API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.abuseipdb.com/pricing'>https://www.abuseipdb.com/pricing</a></li><li>Select the plan required</li><li>Register a new account with an email</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://www.abuseipdb.com/account/api'>https://www.abuseipdb.com/account/api</a></li><li>The API Key is listed under 'Keys'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_abuseipdb:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_abuseipdb:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The minimium AbuseIPDB confidence level to require.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_abuseipdb:confidenceminimum' class='form-control' type=text value=\"90\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of results to retrieve.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_abuseipdb:limit' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10000\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_accounts' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Account Finder (sfp_accounts)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Look for possible associated accounts on over 500 social and other websites such as Instagram, Reddit, etc.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Don't bother looking up names that are just stand-alone first names (too many false positives).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_accounts:ignorenamedict' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Don't bother looking up names that appear in the dictionary.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_accounts:ignoreworddict' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The username must be mentioned on the social media page to consider it valid (helps avoid false positives).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_accounts:musthavename' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look for the existence of account name permutations. Useful to identify fraudulent social media accounts or account squatting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_accounts:permutate' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Extract usernames from e-mail addresses at all? If disabled this can reduce false positives for common usernames but for highly unique usernames it would result in missed accounts.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_accounts:userfromemail' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The minimum length of a username to query across social media sites. Helps avoid false positives for very common short usernames.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_accounts:usernamesize' class='form-control' type=text value=\"4\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_adblock' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>AdBlock Check (sfp_adblock)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plug-in to test if external/internally linked pages\n    would be blocked by AdBlock Plus.<br/><br/>Adblock Plus is a free extension that allows you to customize your web experience.You can block annoying ads, disable tracking and lots more.It’s available for all major desktop browsers and for your mobile devices.\nBlock ads that interrupt your browsing experience.Say goodbye to video ads, pop-ups, flashing banners and more.Blocking these annoyances means pages load faster.\nWith Adblock Plus avoiding tracking and malware is easy.Blocking intrusive ads reduces the risk of \"malvertising\" infections.Blocking tracking stops companies following your online activity.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://adblockplus.org/\" target=_new>https://adblockplus.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>AdBlockPlus block list.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_adblock:blocklist' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"https://easylist-downloads.adblockplus.org/easylist.txt\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_adblock:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_adguard_dns' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>AdGuard DNS (sfp_adguard_dns)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plug-in for looking up whether hosts are blocked by AdGuard DNS servers.<br/><br/>AdGuard DNS is a foolproof way to block Internet ads that does not require installing any applications. It is easy to use, absolutely free, easily set up on any device, and provides you with minimal necessary functions to block ads, counters, malicious websites, and adult content.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://adguard.com/\" target=_new>https://adguard.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_advanced_correlation' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Advanced Correlation Engine (sfp_advanced_correlation)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Advanced correlation and entity resolution module.<br/><br/>Internal correlation engine that analyzes relationships between discovered entities.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"N/A\" target=_new>N/A</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum confidence score for correlations\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable behavioral pattern analysis\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_advanced_correlation:enable_behavioral_analysis' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable cross-platform entity resolution\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_advanced_correlation:enable_entity_resolution' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable geospatial data clustering\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_advanced_correlation:enable_geospatial_clustering' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable temporal pattern analysis\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_advanced_correlation:enable_temporal_analysis' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Radius for geospatial clustering (kilometers)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum depth for entity relationship traversal\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_advanced_correlation:max_entity_depth' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum number of events to form a pattern\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_advanced_correlation:min_pattern_strength' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Time window for temporal analysis (hours)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_advanced_correlation:temporal_window_hours' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ahmia' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Ahmia (sfp_ahmia)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Search the Tor search engine 'Ahmia' for content related to the target.<br/><br/>Ahmia searches hidden services on the Tor network. To access these hidden services,you need the Tor browser bundle. Abuse material is not allowed on Ahmia. See our service blacklist and report abuse material if you find it in the index. It will be removed as soon as possible.\nContributors to Ahmia believe that the Tor network is an important and resilient distributed platform for anonymity and privacy worldwide. By providing a search engine for what many call the \"deep web\" or \"dark net\", Ahmia makes hidden services accessible to a wide range of people, not just Tor network early adopters.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tor</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://ahmia.fi/\" target=_new>https://ahmia.fi/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fetch the darknet pages (via TOR, if enabled) to verify they mention your target.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_ahmia:fetchlinks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Search for human names?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_ahmia:fullnames' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ai_summary' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>AI Threat Intelligence Summarizer (sfp_ai_summary)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Summarizes scan findings using an LLM (e.g., OpenAI's GPT).<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>API key for the LLM provider (e.g., OpenAI).\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Sign up at <a target=_new href='https://platform.openai.com/'>https://platform.openai.com/</a></li><li>Create an API key in your account settings.</li><li>Paste the API key into the module configuration.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ai_summary:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Max events to include in the summary.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ai_summary:max_events' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Model name (e.g., gpt-3.5-turbo).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ai_summary:model' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"gpt-3.5-turbo\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>When to summarize: on_finish or periodic.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ai_summary:summary_frequency' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"on_finish\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_alienvault' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>AlienVault OTX (sfp_alienvault)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plug-in to obtain information from AlienVault Open Threat Exchange (OTX).<br/><br/>The World’s First Truly Open Threat Intelligence Community\nOpen Threat Exchange is the neighborhood watch of the global intelligence community. It enables private companies, independent security researchers, and government agencies to openly collaborate and share the latest information about emerging threats, attack methods, and malicious actors, promoting greater security across the entire community.\nOTX changed the way the intelligence community creates and consumes threat data. In OTX, anyone in the security community can contribute, discuss, research, validate, and share threat data. You can integrate community-generated OTX threat data directly into your AlienVault and third-party security products, so that your threat detection defenses are always up to date with the latest threat intelligence. Today, 100,000 participants in 140 countries contribute over 19 million threat indicators daily.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://otx.alienvault.com/\" target=_new>https://otx.alienvault.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>AlienVault OTX API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://otx.alienvault.com/'>https://otx.alienvault.com/</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://otx.alienvault.com/settings'>https://otx.alienvault.com/settings</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'OTX Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_alienvault:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any co-hosts older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:cohost_age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of URL results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv4 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum IPv4 subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv6 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:maxv6netblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum IPv6 subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:maxv6subnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_alienvault:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any reputation records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:reputation_age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_alienvault:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum AlienVault threat score.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvault:threat_score_min' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_alienvault:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_alienvaultiprep' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>AlienVault IP Reputation (sfp_alienvaultiprep)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Check if an IP or netblock is malicious according to the AlienVault IP Reputation database.<br/><br/>Looking at security through new eyes.\nAT&T Business and AlienVault have joined forces to create AT&T Cybersecurity, with a vision to bring together the people, process, and technology that help businesses of any size stay ahead of threats.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://cybersecurity.att.com/\" target=_new>https://cybersecurity.att.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_alienvaultiprep:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_alienvaultiprep:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_alienvaultiprep:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_alienvaultiprep:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_aparat' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Aparat Monitor (sfp_aparat)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Monitors Aparat for new videos and emits events.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of videos to fetch per user.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_aparat:max_videos' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Aparat usernames.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_aparat:usernames' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_apileak' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>API Key/Secret Leak Detector (sfp_apileak)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Searches for leaked API keys and secrets on GitHub and paste sites.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>GitHub API token.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_apileak:github_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Max search results per query.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_apileak:max_results' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Regex patterns for API keys/secrets.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_apileak:search_patterns' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"(AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}|AIza[0-9A-Za-z-_]{35})\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_apple_itunes' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Apple iTunes (sfp_apple_itunes)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Query Apple iTunes for mobile apps.<br/><br/>The Apple iTunes store is a store for downloading and purchasing apps for Apple devices.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/\" target=_new>https://itunes.apple.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_arbitrum' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Arbitrum Blockchain Monitor (sfp_arbitrum)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Monitors Arbitrum blockchain for transactions and emits events.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Arbitrum addresses.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_arbitrum:addresses' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Arbiscan API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Register at <a target=_new href='https://arbiscan.io/'>https://arbiscan.io/</a></li><li>Get your API key and paste it into the module configuration.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_arbitrum:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>End block number for filtering transactions (0 for latest).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_arbitrum:end_block' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., transfer,contract).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_arbitrum:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"transfer,contract\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of transactions to fetch per address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_arbitrum:max_transactions' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum transaction value (ETH) to include.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_arbitrum:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Start block number for filtering transactions (0 for earliest).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_arbitrum:start_block' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_archiveorg' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Archive.org (sfp_archiveorg)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>\n    SpiderFoot plugin to query archive.org (Wayback Machine) for historic versions of certain pages/files.\n    Emits events for historic versions found, based on input event types and configuration.\n    <br/><br/>Internet Archive is a non-profit library of millions of free books, movies, software, music, websites, and more.\nThe Internet Archive, a 501(c)(3) non-profit, is building a digital library of Internet sites and other cultural artifacts in digital form. Like a paper library, we provide free access to researchers, historians, scholars, the print disabled, and the general public. Our mission is to provide Universal Access to All Knowledge.\nWe began in 1996 by archiving the Internet itself, a medium that was just beginning to grow in use. Like newspapers, the content published on the web was ephemeral - but unlike newspapers, no one was saving it. Today we have 20+ years of web history accessible through the Wayback Machine and we work with 625+ library and other partners through our Archive-It program to identify important web pages.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://archive.org/\" target=_new>https://archive.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of days back to look for older versions of files/pages in the Wayback Machine snapshots. Comma-separate the values, so for example 30,60,90 means to look for snapshots 30 days, 60 days and 90 days back.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_archiveorg:farback' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30,60,90\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of URLs containing Flash.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:flashpages' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of URLs with forms.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:formpages' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of Interesting Files.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:intfiles' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of URLs using Java Applets.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:javapages' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of URLs using Javascript.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:javascriptpages' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of URLs with passwords.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:passwordpages' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of purely static URLs.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:staticpages' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of URLs accepting uploads.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:uploadpages' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query the Wayback Machine for historic versions of URLs using Javascript frameworks.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_archiveorg:webframeworkpages' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_arin' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ARIN (sfp_arin)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to query the ARIN internet registry for contact information.<br/><br/>ARIN is a nonprofit, member-based organization that administers IP addresses & ASNs in support of the operation and growth of the Internet.\nEstablished in December 1997 as a Regional Internet Registry, the American Registry for Internet Numbers (ARIN) is responsible for the management and distribution of Internet number resources such as Internet Protocol (IP) addresses and Autonomous System Numbers (ASNs). ARIN manages these resources within its service region, which is comprised of Canada, the United States, and many Caribbean and North Atlantic islands.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.arin.net/\" target=_new>https://www.arin.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_azureblobstorage' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Azure Blob Finder (sfp_azureblobstorage)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Search for potential Azure blobs associated with the target and attempt to list their contents.<br/><br/>Massively scalable and secure object storage for cloud-native workloads,archives, data lakes, high-performance computing and machine learning.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/storage/blobs/\" target=_new>https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/storage/blobs/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>List of suffixes to append to domains tried as blob storage names\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_azureblobstorage:suffixes' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"test,dev,web,beta,bucket,space,files,content,data,prod,staging,production,stage,app,media,development,-test,-dev,-web,-beta,-bucket,-space,-files,-content,-data,-prod,-staging,-production,-stage,-app,-media,-development\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_bambenek' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Bambenek Consulting (sfp_bambenek)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a host/domain or IP appears in Bambenek Consulting feeds.<br/><br/>Bambenek Consulting provides cybersecurity intelligence including IP and domain blacklists based on threat intelligence.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.bambenekconsulting.com/\" target=_new>https://www.bambenekconsulting.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable Bambenek C2 feed checks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_bambenek:c2_feed' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bambenek:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_bambenek:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_bambenek:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable Bambenek DGA feed checks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_bambenek:dga_feed' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_base64' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Base64 Decoder (sfp_base64)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify Base64-encoded strings in URLs.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>The minimum length a string that looks like a base64-encoded string needs to be.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_base64:minlength' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_bgpview' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>BGPView (sfp_bgpview)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to obtain network information from BGPView API.<br/><br/>BGPView is a simple API allowing consumers to view all sort of analytics data about the current state and structure of the internet.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://bgpview.io/\" target=_new>https://bgpview.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_binaryedge' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>BinaryEdge (sfp_binaryedge)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to query BinaryEdge API.<br/><br/>We scan the entire public internet, create real-time threat intelligence streams, and reports that show the exposure of what is connected to the Internet.\nWe have built a distributed platform of scanners and honeypots, to acquire, classify and correlate different types of data.\nWe use all of these datapoints to match those digital assets to an organization, allowing us to provide a global, up-to-date, view of organizations known and unknown assets.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.binaryedge.io/\" target=_new>https://www.binaryedge.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>BinaryEdge.io API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.binaryedge.io/pricing.html'>https://www.binaryedge.io/pricing.html</a></li><li>Select a plan</li><li>Sign up with new account</li><li>Go to Account</li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Access'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binaryedge:binaryedge_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any vulnerability records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binaryedge:cve_age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binaryedge:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binaryedge:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages to iterate through, to avoid exceeding BinaryEdge API usage limits. APIv2 has a maximum of 500 pages (10,000 results).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binaryedge:maxpages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binaryedge:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_binaryedge:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any discovered open ports/banners older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binaryedge:port_age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"90\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_binaryedge:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any torrent records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binaryedge:torrent_age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify that any hostnames found on the target domain still resolve?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_binaryedge:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_bingsearch' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Bing (sfp_bingsearch)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to obtain information from Bing to identify sub-domains and links.<br/><br/>The Bing Search APIs let you build web-connected apps and services that find webpages, images, news, locations, and more without advertisements.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.bing.com/\" target=_new>https://www.bing.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Bing API Key for Bing search.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/cognitive-services/bing-web-search-api/'>https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/cognitive-services/bing-web-search-api/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Select on Bing Custom Search</li><li>The API keys are listed under 'Key1' and 'Key2' (both should work)</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bingsearch:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of max bing results to request from the API.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bingsearch:pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"20\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_bingsharedip' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Bing (Shared IPs) (sfp_bingsharedip)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to search Bing for hosts sharing the same IP.<br/><br/>The Bing Search APIs let you build web-connected apps and services that find webpages, images, news, locations, and more without advertisements.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.bing.com/\" target=_new>https://www.bing.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Bing API Key for shared IP search.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/cognitive-services/bing-web-search-api/'>https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/cognitive-services/bing-web-search-api/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Select on Bing Custom Search</li><li>The API keys are listed under 'Key1' and 'Key2' (both should work)</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bingsharedip:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_bingsharedip:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bingsharedip:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of max bing results to request from API.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bingsharedip:pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"20\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_bingsharedip:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_binstring' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Binary String Extractor (sfp_binstring)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify strings in binary content.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>errorprone</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>File types to fetch and analyse.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binstring:fileexts' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"png,gif,jpg,jpeg,tiff,tif,ico,flv,mp4,mp3,avi,mpg,mpeg,dat,mov,swf,exe,bin\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore strings with these characters, as they may just be garbage ASCII.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binstring:filterchars' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"#}{|%^&*()=+,;[]~\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum file size in bytes to download for analysis.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binstring:maxfilesize' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1000000\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting strings from a single binary after this many are found.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binstring:maxwords' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Upon finding a string in a binary, ensure it is at least this length. Helps weed out false positives.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_binstring:minwordsize' class='form-control' type=text value=\"5\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Use the dictionary to further reduce false positives - any string found must contain a word from the dictionary (can be very slow, especially for larger files).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_binstring:usedict' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_bitcoin' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Bitcoin Finder (sfp_bitcoin)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify bitcoin addresses in scraped webpages.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_bitcoinwhoswho' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Bitcoin Who's Who (sfp_bitcoinwhoswho)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check Bitcoin addresses against the Bitcoin Who's Who database of suspect/malicious addresses.<br/><br/>Bitcoin Who's Who is dedicated to profiling the extraordinary members of the bitcoin ecosystem.Our goal is to help you verify a bitcoin address owner and avoid a bitcoin scam or fraud.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://bitcoinwhoswho.com/\" target=_new>https://bitcoinwhoswho.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Bitcoin Who's Who API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://bitcoinwhoswho.com/signup'>https://bitcoinwhoswho.com/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Verify your email and sign into your account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://bitcoinwhoswho.com/api/register'>https://bitcoinwhoswho.com/api/register</a> and request an API Key</li><li>Wait for a few days, you'll receive it to your email</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bitcoinwhoswho:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_blockchain' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Blockchain (sfp_blockchain)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to query blockchain.info to find the balance of identified bitcoin wallet addresses.<br/><br/>Blockchain Exchange is the most secure place to buy, sell, and trade crypto.\nUse the most popular block explorer to search and verify transactions on the Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Bitcoin Cash blockchains.\nStay on top of Bitcoin and other top cryptocurrency prices, news, and market information.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.blockchain.com/\" target=_new>https://www.blockchain.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_blockchain_analytics' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Advanced Blockchain Analytics (sfp_blockchain_analytics)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Advanced blockchain and cryptocurrency investigation module.<br/><br/>Advanced blockchain analysis using multiple cryptocurrency APIs for comprehensive investigation.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Secondary Networks</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://various-blockchain-apis.com\" target=_new>https://various-blockchain-apis.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Blockchair API key for additional blockchain data\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Sign up for BlockCypher API at <a target=_new href='https://www.blockcypher.com/dev/'>https://www.blockcypher.com/dev/</a></li><li>Get Etherscan API key at <a target=_new href='https://etherscan.io/apis'>https://etherscan.io/apis</a></li><li>Optional: Get additional API keys for better coverage</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:blockchair_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>BlockCypher API key for Bitcoin analysis\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Sign up for BlockCypher API at <a target=_new href='https://www.blockcypher.com/dev/'>https://www.blockcypher.com/dev/</a></li><li>Get Etherscan API key at <a target=_new href='https://etherscan.io/apis'>https://etherscan.io/apis</a></li><li>Optional: Get additional API keys for better coverage</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:blockcypher_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Depth for address clustering analysis\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:clustering_depth' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable wallet clustering analysis\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:enable_clustering_analysis' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable risk scoring for addresses\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:enable_risk_scoring' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check addresses against sanctions lists\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:enable_sanctions_checking' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable detailed transaction pattern analysis\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:enable_transaction_analysis' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Etherscan API key for Ethereum analysis\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Sign up for BlockCypher API at <a target=_new href='https://www.blockcypher.com/dev/'>https://www.blockcypher.com/dev/</a></li><li>Get Etherscan API key at <a target=_new href='https://etherscan.io/apis'>https://etherscan.io/apis</a></li><li>Optional: Get additional API keys for better coverage</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:etherscan_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of transactions to analyze per address\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_blockchain_analytics:max_transactions_analyze' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Risk score threshold for flagging addresses\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_blocklistde' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>blocklist.de (sfp_blocklistde)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a netblock or IP is malicious according to blocklist.de.<br/><br/>www.blocklist.de is a free and voluntary service provided by a Fraud/Abuse-specialist, whose servers are often attacked via SSH-, Mail-Login-, FTP-, Webserver- and other services.\nThe mission is to report any and all attacks to the respective abuse departments of the infected PCs/servers, to ensure that the responsible provider can inform their customer about the infection and disable the attacker.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://www.blocklist.de/en/index.html\" target=_new>http://www.blocklist.de/en/index.html</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_blocklistde:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_blocklistde:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_blocklistde:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_blocklistde:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_bluesky' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Bluesky Monitor (sfp_bluesky)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to monitor Bluesky for posts and emit events.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Bluesky access token.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bluesky:access_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., post,reply,like).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bluesky:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"post,reply,like\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of posts to fetch per user.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bluesky:max_posts' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bluesky:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Timestamp or token for incremental sync (empty for full history).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bluesky:since' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Bluesky username to monitor.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bluesky:username' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_bnb' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>BNB Chain Monitor (sfp_bnb)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to monitor Binance Smart Chain (BNB) for transactions and emit events.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of BNB addresses.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bnb:addresses' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>BscScan API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Register at <a target=_new href='https://bscscan.com/'>https://bscscan.com/</a></li><li>Get your API key and paste it into the module configuration.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bnb:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>End block number for filtering transactions (0 for latest).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bnb:end_block' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., transfer,contract).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bnb:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"transfer,contract\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of transactions to fetch per address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bnb:max_transactions' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum transaction value (BNB) to include.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bnb:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Start block number for filtering transactions (0 for earliest).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_bnb:start_block' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_botscout' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>BotScout (sfp_botscout)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to search BotScout.com for malicious IPs and email addresses.<br/><br/>BotScout helps prevent automated web scripts, known as \"bots\", from registering on forums, polluting databases, spreading spam, and abusing forms on web sites. We do this by tracking the names, IPs, and email addresses that bots use and logging them as unique signatures for future reference. We also provide a simple yet powerful API that you can use to test forms when they're submitted on your site.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://botscout.com/\" target=_new>https://botscout.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Botscout.com API key. Without this you will be limited to 100 look-ups per day.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='http://botscout.com/getkey.htm'>http://botscout.com/getkey.htm</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>The API key will be emailed to your account</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_botscout:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_botvrij' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>botvrij.eu (sfp_botvrij)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a domain is malicious according to botvrij.eu.<br/><br/>Botvrij.eu provides different sets  of open source IOCs that you can use in your  security devices to detect possible malicious activity.\nThe information contains network info (IPs), file hashes, file paths, domain names, URLs.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://botvrij.eu/\" target=_new>https://botvrij.eu/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_botvrij:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_botvrij:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_botvrij:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_builtwith' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>BuiltWith (sfp_builtwith)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to query BuiltWith.com's Domain API for information about your target's web technology stack, e-mail addresses and more.<br/><br/>Build lists of websites from our database of 38,701+ web technologies and over a quarter of a billion websites showing which sites use shopping carts, analytics, hosting and many more. Filter by location, traffic, vertical and more.\nKnow your prospects platform before you talk to them. Improve your conversions with validated market adoption.\nGet advanced technology market share information and country based analytics for all web technologies.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://builtwith.com/\" target=_new>https://builtwith.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Builtwith.com Domain API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://api.builtwith.com/free-api'>https://api.builtwith.com/free-api</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://api.builtwith.com/free-api'>https://api.builtwith.com/free-api</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_builtwith:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The maximum age of the data returned, in days, in order to be considered valid.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_builtwith:maxage' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_c99' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>C99 (sfp_c99)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to query the C99 API which offers various data (geo location, proxy detection, phone lookup, etc).<br/><br/>C99 API service is versatile source of information. They offer over 57 different APIs of which 10 are integrated in this module. APIs that are integrated are subdomain finder, phone lookup, Skype resolver, IP to Skype, firewall technology WAF detector, domain history, IP to domains, IP geo location, proxy detector.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://api.c99.nl/\" target=_new>https://api.c99.nl/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>C99 API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://api.c99.nl'>https://api.c99.nl</a></li><li>Click shop in the top navigation or go to <a target=_new href='https://api.c99.nl/dashboard/shop'>https://api.c99.nl/dashboard/shop</a></li><li>Click purchase key on option 'C99.NL API KEY' (you can also purchase a 1 year key)</li><li>You will receive your API key by email.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_c99:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_c99:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_c99:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify identified domains still resolve to the associated specified IP address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_c99:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_callername' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CallerName (sfp_callername)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to lookup US phone number location and reputation information.<br/><br/>CallerName is a free, reverse phone lookup service for both cell and landline numbers. It relies on a database of white pages and business pages taken from public sources. The easy-to-use and streamlined interface allow users to look up the caller ID information of any number quickly. Just type the unknown number into the search bar to start. You need not pay nor register to use this 100% free service.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://callername.com/\" target=_new>http://callername.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_censys' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Censys (sfp_censys)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to obtain host information from Censys.io.<br/><br/>Discover exposures and other common entry points for attackers.\nCensys scans the entire internet constantly, including obscure ports. We use a combination of banner grabs and deep protocol handshakes to provide industry-leading visibility and an accurate depiction of what is live on the internet.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://censys.io/\" target=_new>https://censys.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_censys:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"90\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Censys.io API Secret.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://censys.io/'>https://censys.io/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://censys.io/account'>https://censys.io/account</a></li><li>Click on 'API'</li><li>The API key combination is listed under 'API ID' and 'Secret'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_censys:censys_api_key_secret' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Censys.io API UID.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://censys.io/'>https://censys.io/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://censys.io/account'>https://censys.io/account</a></li><li>Click on 'API'</li><li>The API key combination is listed under 'API ID' and 'Secret'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_censys:censys_api_key_uid' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_censys:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_censys:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv6 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_censys:maxv6netblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_censys:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_certspotter' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CertSpotter (sfp_certspotter)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to gather information about SSL certificates from SSLMate CertSpotter API.<br/><br/>Cert Spotter monitors your domains for expiring, unauthorized, and invalid SSL certificates, so you can act before an incident, not after.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://sslmate.com/certspotter/\" target=_new>https://sslmate.com/certspotter/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>CertSpotter API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://sslmate.com/signup?for=ct_search_api'>https://sslmate.com/signup?for=ct_search_api</a></li><li>Register a new account with an email</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://sslmate.com/account/'>https://sslmate.com/account/</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Credentials'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_certspotter:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of days in the future a certificate expires to consider it as expiring.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_certspotter:certexpiringdays' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_certspotter:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"20\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify certificate subject alternative names resolve.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_certspotter:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_cinsscore' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CINS Army List (sfp_cinsscore)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if an IP address is malicious according to the CINS Army list.<br/><br/>Leveraging data from our network of Sentinel devices and other trusted InfoSec sources, CINS is a Threat Intelligence database that provides an accurate and timely score for any IP address in the world.The CINS Army list is a subset of the CINS Active Threat Intelligence ruleset.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://cinsscore.com/\" target=_new>https://cinsscore.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_cinsscore:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliate IP addresses?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cinsscore:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cinsscore:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cinsscore:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_circllu' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CIRCL.LU (sfp_circllu)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to obtain information from CIRCL.LU's Passive DNS and Passive SSL databases.<br/><br/>The Computer Incident Response Center Luxembourg (CIRCL) is a government-driven initiative designed to gather, review, report and respond to computer security threats and incidents.\nCIRCL provides a reliable and trusted point of contact for any users, companies and organizations based in Luxembourg, for the handling of attacks and incidents. Its team of experts acts like a fire brigade, with the ability to react promptly and efficiently whenever threats are suspected, detected or incidents occur.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.circl.lu/\" target=_new>https://www.circl.lu/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any Passive DNS records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_circllu:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>CIRCL.LU login.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.circl.lu/contact/'>https://www.circl.lu/contact/</a></li><li>Contact with email or phone to request access for Passive DNS and Passive SSL API services</li><li>The API access will be provided once approved</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_circllu:api_key_login' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>CIRCL.LU password.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.circl.lu/contact/'>https://www.circl.lu/contact/</a></li><li>Contact with email or phone to request access for Passive DNS and Passive SSL API services</li><li>The API access will be provided once approved</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_circllu:api_key_password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_circllu:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_circllu:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_circllu:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_cisco_umbrella' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Cisco Umbrella Investigate (sfp_cisco_umbrella)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to query Cisco Umbrella Investigate API for domain information.<br/><br/>Cisco Umbrella Investigate provides insights into domain reputation, security categories, malware analysis, and other threat intelligence data.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://umbrella.cisco.com/products/investigate\" target=_new>https://umbrella.cisco.com/products/investigate</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Cisco Umbrella Investigate API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://umbrella.cisco.com/products/investigate'>https://umbrella.cisco.com/products/investigate</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account or log in with your Cisco account</li><li>Navigate to 'API Keys' under 'Configuration'</li><li>Generate a new API key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_cisco_umbrella:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between API requests (in seconds).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_cisco_umbrella:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_citadel' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Leak-Lookup (sfp_citadel)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to search Leak-Lookup.com's database of breaches.<br/><br/>Leak-Lookup allows you to search across thousands of data breaches to stay on top of credentials that may have been compromised in the wild.\nThe creators came together when they realized they had a vast trove of data that could be of great value to pen-testers seeking weaknesses in client passwords and those concerned about which of their credentials have been leaked into the wild.\nAlways looking forward, Leak-Lookup invests all of its profits back into securing the latest data breaches and leaks / dumps as they become available, ensuring that as well as historical data, Leak-Lookup becomes a field leader in credential monitoring.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://leak-lookup.com/\" target=_new>https://leak-lookup.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Leak-Lookup API key. Without this you're limited to the public API.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://leak-lookup.com'>https://leak-lookup.com</a></li><li>Register an account</li><li>Login to your account</li><li>Click on 'Account'</li><li>Click on 'API'</li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_citadel:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Custom timeout due to heavy traffic at times.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_citadel:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"60\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_cleanbrowsing' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CleanBrowsing.org (sfp_cleanbrowsing)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a host would be blocked by CleanBrowsing.org DNS content filters.<br/><br/>You get to decide what type of content is allowed in your home or network via our DNS-based content filtering service. Parents can protect their kids from adult content, schools can be CIPA compliant and businesses can block malicious domains and gain visibility into their network.\nCleanBrowsing is a DNS-based content filtering service that offers a safe way to browse the web without surprises. It intercepts domain requests and filter sites that should be blocked, based on your requirements. Our free family filter, for example, blocks adult content, while still allowing Google, Youtube, Bing, DuckDuckGo and the rest of the web to load safely.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://cleanbrowsing.org/\" target=_new>https://cleanbrowsing.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_cleantalk' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CleanTalk Spam List (sfp_cleantalk)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a netblock or IP address is on CleanTalk.org's spam IP list.<br/><br/>CleanTalk is a Cloud-Based spam filtering service that allows you to protect your website from spam. CleanTalk provides spam protection that invisible to visitors without using captcha or other methods when visitors have to prove that they are real people.\nCleanTalk provides cloud anti-spam solutions for CMS and we developed plugins for the most of popular CMS: WordPress anti-spam plugin, Joomla anti-spam plugin, Drupal and etc. With our simple cloud spam checker, you can be sure your website is protected from spam bots, spam comments, and users.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://cleantalk.org\" target=_new>https://cleantalk.org</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_cleantalk:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliate IP addresses?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cleantalk:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cleantalk:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cleantalk:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_cloudflaredns' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CloudFlare DNS (sfp_cloudflaredns)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a host would be blocked by CloudFlare DNS content filters.<br/><br/>1.1.1.1 for Families is the easiest way to add a layer of protection to your home network and protect it from malware and adult content. 1.1.1.1 for Families leverages Cloudflare’s global network to ensure that it is fast and secure around the world.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.cloudflare.com/\" target=_new>https://www.cloudflare.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_cloudfront' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Amazon CloudFront Detector (sfp_cloudfront)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify domains using Amazon CloudFront CDN.<br/><br/>Amazon CloudFront is a fast content delivery network (CDN) service that securely delivers data, videos, applications, and APIs to customers globally with low latency and high transfer speeds.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/cloudfront/\" target=_new>https://aws.amazon.com/cloudfront/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check for CloudFront CNAME records.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cloudfront:verify_cname' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check DNS records for CloudFront domains.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cloudfront:verify_dns' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check HTTP response headers for CloudFront signatures.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cloudfront:verify_headers' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_coinblocker' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CoinBlocker Lists (sfp_coinblocker)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a domain appears on CoinBlocker lists.<br/><br/>The CoinBlockerLists are a project to prevent illegal mining in browsers or other applications using IPlists and URLLists.\nIt's not just to block everything without any reason, but to protect Internet users from illegal mining.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://zerodot1.gitlab.io/CoinBlockerListsWeb/\" target=_new>https://zerodot1.gitlab.io/CoinBlockerListsWeb/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_coinblocker:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_coinblocker:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_coinblocker:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_commoncrawl' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CommonCrawl (sfp_commoncrawl)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to search CommonCrawl.org for URLs related to the target.<br/><br/>We build and maintain an open repository of web crawl data that can be accessed and analyzed by anyone.\nEveryone should have the opportunity to indulge their curiosities, analyze the world and pursue brilliant ideas. Small startups or even individuals can now access high quality crawl data that was previously only available to large search engine corporations.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://commoncrawl.org/\" target=_new>http://commoncrawl.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of most recent indexes to attempt, because results tend to be occasionally patchy.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_commoncrawl:indexes' class='form-control' type=text value=\"6\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_comodo' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Comodo Secure DNS (sfp_comodo)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a host would be blocked by Comodo Secure DNS.<br/><br/>Comodo Secure DNS is a domain name resolution service that resolves your DNS requests through our worldwide network of redundant DNS servers, bringing you the most reliable fully redundant DNS service anywhere, for a safer, smarter and faster Internet experience.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.comodo.com/secure-dns/\" target=_new>https://www.comodo.com/secure-dns/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_company' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Company Name Extractor (sfp_company)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify company names in scraped webpages.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Filter out company names that originated from CSS/JS content. Enabling this avoids detection of popular Javascript and web framework author company names.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_company:filterjscss' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_cookie' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Cookie Extractor (sfp_cookie)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to extract cookies from HTTP headers.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_countryname' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Country Name Extractor (sfp_countryname)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify country names in any obtained data.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Obtain country name from affiliate sites\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_countryname:affiliate' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Obtain country name from co-hosted sites\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_countryname:cohosted' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Parse TLDs not associated with any country as default country domains\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_countryname:noncountrytld' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Obtain country name from similar domains\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_countryname:similardomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_creditcard' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Credit Card Number Extractor (sfp_creditcard)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify credit card numbers in scraped webpages.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>errorprone</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_criminalip' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CriminalIP (sfp_criminalip)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to obtain information from CriminalIP.<br/><br/>CriminalIP provides powerful APIs to help you enrich any user experience or automate any workflow.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.criminalip.io/\" target=_new>https://www.criminalip.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>CriminalIP API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.criminalip.io/users/signup'>https://www.criminalip.io/users/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.criminalip.io/api/'>https://www.criminalip.io/api/</a></li><li>Your API Key will be listed under 'API Key'.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_criminalip:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_crobat_api' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Crobat API (sfp_crobat_api)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to search Crobat API for subdomains.<br/><br/>The entire Rapid7 Sonar DNS dataset indexed, available at your fingertips.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://sonar.omnisint.io/\" target=_new>https://sonar.omnisint.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_crobat_api:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_crobat_api:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>DNS resolve each identified subdomain.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_crobat_api:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_crossref' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Cross-Referencer (sfp_crossref)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify potential affiliate domains.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check the base URL of the potential affiliate if no direct affiliation found?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_crossref:checkbase' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_crt' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Certificate Transparency (sfp_crt)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to gather information about SSL certificates from crt.sh.<br/><br/>Free CT Log Certificate Search Tool from Sectigo (formerly Comodo CA).</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://crt.sh/\" target=_new>https://crt.sh/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fetch each certificate found, for processing by other modules.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_crt:fetchcerts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify certificate subject alternative names resolve.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_crt:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_crxcavator' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CRXcavator (sfp_crxcavator)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to query CRXcavator for Chrome extensions.<br/><br/>CRXcavator automatically scans the entire Chrome Web Store every 3 hours and produces a quantified risk score for each Chrome Extension based on several factors.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://crxcavator.io/\" target=_new>https://crxcavator.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify identified hostnames resolve.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_crxcavator:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_customfeed' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Custom Threat Feed (sfp_customfeed)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a host/domain, netblock, ASN or IP is malicious according to your custom feed.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum age of data in hours before re-downloading. 0 to always download.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_customfeed:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_customfeed:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_customfeed:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The URL where the feed can be found. Exact matching is performed so the format must be a single line per host, ASN, domain, IP or netblock.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_customfeed:url' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_cybercrimetracker' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>CyberCrime-Tracker.net (sfp_cybercrimetracker)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if a host/domain or IP address is malicious according to CyberCrime-Tracker.net.<br/><br/>CyberCrime is a C&C panel tracker, in other words, it lists the administration interfaces of certain in-the-wild botnets.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://cybercrime-tracker.net/\" target=_new>https://cybercrime-tracker.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_cybercrimetracker:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cybercrimetracker:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_cybercrimetracker:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_debounce' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Debounce (sfp_debounce)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check whether an email is disposable using Debounce API.<br/><br/>DeBounce provides a free & powerful API endpoint for checking a domain or email address against a realtime up-to-date list of disposable domains.CORS is enabled for all originating domains, so you can call the API directly from your client-side code.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://debounce.io/\" target=_new>https://debounce.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_deepinfo' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Deepinfo (sfp_deepinfo)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Deepinfo API integration for SpiderFoot<br/><br/>Deepinfo provides relevant data and insights that empower cybersecurity professionals by providing access to an extensive database and reliable indicators.Deepinfo has the data you need to understand what's going on on the Internet, we are dealing with terabytes of data, hundreds of data sources, billions of lines of raw data.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://deepinfo.com/\" target=_new>https://deepinfo.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Deepinfo API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://deepinfo.info/request-demo'>https://deepinfo.info/request-demo</a></li><li>Request a demo account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://platform.deepinfo.com/app/settings/organization/api-keys'>https://platform.deepinfo.com/app/settings/organization/api-keys</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Keys'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_deepinfo:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dehashed' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Dehashed (sfp_dehashed)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Dehashed API integration for SpiderFoot<br/><br/>Have you been compromised? DeHashed provides free deep-web scans and protection against credential leaks. A modern personal asset search engine created for security analysts, journalists, security companies, and everyday people to help secure accounts and provide insight on compromised assets. Free breach alerts & breach notifications.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.dehashed.com/\" target=_new>https://www.dehashed.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Dehashed API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.dehashed.com/registerRegister'>https://www.dehashed.com/registerRegister</a> a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.dehashed.com/profile'>https://www.dehashed.com/profile</a></li><li>Your API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dehashed:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Dehashed username.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.dehashed.com/registerRegister'>https://www.dehashed.com/registerRegister</a> a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.dehashed.com/profile'>https://www.dehashed.com/profile</a></li><li>Your API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dehashed:api_key_username' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages to fetch(Max: 10 pages)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dehashed:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of seconds to wait between each API call.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dehashed:pause' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of results per page.(Max: 10000)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dehashed:per_page' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10000\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dideo' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Dideo.ir Monitor (sfp_dideo)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of keywords to search for.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dideo:keywords' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of videos to fetch per search.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dideo:max_videos' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_digitaloceanspace' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Digital Ocean Space Finder (sfp_digitaloceanspace)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Digital Ocean Space Finder<br/><br/>Store and deliver vast amounts of content.S3-compatible object storage with a built-in CDN that makes scaling easy, reliable, and affordable.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.digitalocean.com/products/spaces/\" target=_new>https://www.digitalocean.com/products/spaces/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Different Digital Ocean locations to check where spaces may exist.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_digitaloceanspace:endpoints' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com,sgp1.digitaloceanspaces.com,ams3.digitaloceanspaces.com\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>List of suffixes to append to domains tried as space names\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_digitaloceanspace:suffixes' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"test,dev,web,beta,bucket,space,files,content,data,prod,staging,production,stage,app,media,development,-test,-dev,-web,-beta,-bucket,-space,-files,-content,-data,-prod,-staging,-production,-stage,-app,-media,-development\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_discord' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Discord Channel Monitor (sfp_discord)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Discord Channel Monitor<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Discord bot token.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_discord:bot_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Discord channel IDs.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_discord:channel_ids' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per channel.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_discord:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dns_for_family' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNS for Family (sfp_dns_for_family)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>DNS for Family<br/><br/>DNS for Family aims to block websites which are considered as porn. So that you and your children can safely surf internet to their heart's desire, without worrying to be followed to harmful websites.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://dnsforfamily.com/\" target=_new>https://dnsforfamily.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dnsbrute' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNS Brute-forcer (sfp_dnsbrute)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to brute-force hostnames and sub-domains.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Try a list of about 750 common hostnames/sub-domains.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsbrute:commons' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Only attempt to brute-force names on domain names, not hostnames (some hostnames are also sub-domains).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsbrute:domainonly' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>For any host found, try appending 1, 01, 001, -1, -01, -001, 2, 02, etc. (up to 10)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsbrute:numbersuffix' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Limit using the number suffixes for hosts that have already been resolved? If disabled this will significantly extend the duration of scans.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsbrute:numbersuffixlimit' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If wildcard DNS is detected, don't bother brute-forcing.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsbrute:skipcommonwildcard' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Try a further 10,000 common hostnames/sub-domains. Will make the scan much slower.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsbrute:top10000' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dnscommonsrv' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNS Common SRV (sfp_dnscommonsrv)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to brute-force common DNS SRV records.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dnsdumpster' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNSDumpster (sfp_dnsdumpster)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for passive subdomain enumeration using HackerTarget's DNSDumpster.<br/><br/>DNSdumpster.com is a FREE domain research tool that can discover hosts related to a domain.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://dnsdumpster.com/\" target=_new>https://dnsdumpster.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dnsgrep' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNSGrep (sfp_dnsgrep)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for retrieving domain names from Rapid7 Sonar Project data sets using DNSGrep API.<br/><br/>Offering researchers and community members open access to data from Project Sonar, which conducts internet-wide surveys to gain insights into global exposure to common vulnerabilities.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://opendata.rapid7.com/\" target=_new>https://opendata.rapid7.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>DNS resolve each identified domain.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsgrep:dns_resolve' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query timeout, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dnsgrep:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dnsneighbor' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNS Look-aside (sfp_dnsneighbor)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for gathering IP addresses from sub-domains and hostnames identified, and optionally affiliates.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>If look-aside is enabled, the netmask size (in CIDR notation) to check. Default is 4 bits (16 hosts).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dnsneighbor:lookasidebits' class='form-control' type=text value=\"4\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Validate that reverse-resolved hostnames still resolve back to that IP before considering them as aliases of your target.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsneighbor:validatereverse' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dnsraw' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNS Raw Records (sfp_dnsraw)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for collecting raw DNS records such as MX, TXT and others.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify identified hostnames resolve.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsraw:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dnsresolve' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNS Resolver (sfp_dnsresolve)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for resolving DNS records.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum owned IPv4 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dnsresolve:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum owned IPv6 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dnsresolve:maxv6netblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsresolve:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If wildcard DNS is detected, only attempt to look up the first common sub-domain from the common sub-domain list.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsresolve:skipcommononwildcard' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Validate that reverse-resolved hostnames still resolve back to that IP before considering them as aliases of your target.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dnsresolve:validatereverse' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dnszonexfer' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DNS Zone Transfer (sfp_dnszonexfer)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for attempting a DNS zone transfer.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Timeout in seconds\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dnszonexfer:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_douyin' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Douyin Monitor (sfp_douyin)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Douyin plugin for monitoring video uploads.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of videos to fetch per user.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_douyin:max_videos' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Douyin usernames.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_douyin:usernames' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_dronebl' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DroneBL (sfp_dronebl)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>DroneBL plugin for querying the DroneBL database.<br/><br/>DroneBL is a realtime monitor of abusable IPs, which has the goal of stopping abuse of infected machines.\nA real-time tracker of abusable IPs.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://dronebl.org/\" target=_new>https://dronebl.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dronebl:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_dronebl:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dronebl:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_dronebl:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_duckduckgo' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>DuckDuckGo (sfp_duckduckgo)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>DuckDuckGo plugin for querying DuckDuckGo's API.<br/><br/>Our Instant Answer API gives you free access to many of our instant answers like: topic summaries , categories, disambiguation, and !bang redirects.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://duckduckgo.com/\" target=_new>https://duckduckgo.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>For affiliates, look up the domain name, not the hostname. This will usually return more meaningful information about the affiliate.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_duckduckgo:affiliatedomains' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_email' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>E-Mail Address Extractor (sfp_email)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify e-mail addresses in scraped webpages.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_emailcrawlr' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>EmailCrawlr (sfp_emailcrawlr)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>EmailCrawlr plugin for searching email addresses and phone numbers associated with a domain.<br/><br/>By using the EmailCrawlr JSON API you can: Get key information about company websites.\nFind all email addresses associated with a domain.\nGet social accounts associated with an email.\nVerify email address deliverability.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://emailcrawlr.com/\" target=_new>https://emailcrawlr.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>EmailCrawlr API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://emailcrawlr.com'>https://emailcrawlr.com</a></li><li>Sign up for free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://emailcrawlr.com/dashboard'>https://emailcrawlr.com/dashboard</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_emailcrawlr:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_emailcrawlr:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_emailformat' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>EmailFormat (sfp_emailformat)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>EmailFormat plugin for looking up email address formats.<br/><br/>Save time and energy - find the email address formats in use at thousands of companies.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.email-format.com/\" target=_new>https://www.email-format.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_emailrep' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>EmailRep (sfp_emailrep)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to search EmailRep.io for email address reputation.<br/><br/>Illuminate the \"reputation\" behind an email address.\nEmailRep uses hundreds of factors like domain age, traffic rankings, presence on social media sites, professional networking sites, personal connections, public records, deliverability, data breaches, dark web credential leaks, phishing emails, threat actor emails, and more to answer these types of questions.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://emailrep.io/\" target=_new>https://emailrep.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>EmailRep API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://emailrep.io/free'>https://emailrep.io/free</a></li><li>Request a free API Key</li><li>The API key will be sent to registered email account on approval</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_emailrep:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_emergingthreats' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Emerging Threats (sfp_emergingthreats)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for checking IP addresses against EmergingThreats.net.<br/><br/>Emerging Threats delivers the most timely and accurate threat intelligence.\nEmerging Threat (ET) intelligence helps prevent attacks and reduce risk by helping you understand the historical context of where these threats originated, who is behind them, when have they attacked, what methods they used, and what they're after. Get on-demand access to current and historical metadata on IPs, domains, and other related threat intelligence to help research threats and investigate incidents.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://rules.emergingthreats.net/\" target=_new>https://rules.emergingthreats.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_emergingthreats:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliate IP addresses?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_emergingthreats:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_emergingthreats:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_emergingthreats:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_errors' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Error String Extractor (sfp_errors)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify common error messages in content like SQL errors, etc.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ethereum' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Ethereum Address Extractor (sfp_ethereum)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for extracting Ethereum addresses.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Ethereum addresses.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ethereum:addresses' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Etherscan API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Register at <a target=_new href='https://etherscan.io/'>https://etherscan.io/</a></li><li>Get your API key and paste it into the module configuration.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ethereum:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>End block number for filtering transactions (0 for latest).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ethereum:end_block' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., transfer,contract).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ethereum:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"transfer,contract\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of transactions to fetch per address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ethereum:max_transactions' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum transaction value (ETH) to include.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ethereum:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Start block number for filtering transactions (0 for earliest).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ethereum:start_block' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_etherscan' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Etherscan (sfp_etherscan)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for querying Etherscan API.<br/><br/>Etherscan allows you to explore and search the Ethereum blockchain for transactions, addresses, tokens, prices and other activities taking place on Ethereum (ETH)</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://etherscan.io\" target=_new>https://etherscan.io</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>API Key for etherscan.io\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://etherscan.io'>https://etherscan.io</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Browse to <a target=_new href='https://etherscan.io/myapikey'>https://etherscan.io/myapikey</a></li><li>Click on Add beside API Key</li><li>Your API Key will be listed under API Key Token</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_etherscan:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of seconds to wait between each API call.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_etherscan:pause' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_filemeta' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>File Metadata Extractor (sfp_filemeta)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for extracting file metadata.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>File extensions of files you want to analyze the meta data of (only PDF, DOCX, XLSX and PPTX are supported.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_filemeta:fileexts' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"docx,pptx,pdf,jpg,jpeg,tiff,tif\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Download timeout for files, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_filemeta:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"300\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_flickr' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Flickr (sfp_flickr)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for searching Flickr API for domains, URLs and emails related to the specified domain.<br/><br/>Flickr is almost certainly the best online photo management and sharing application in the world.\n On Flickr, members upload photos, share them securely, supplement their photos with metadata like license information, geo-location, people, tags, etc., and interact with their family, friends, contacts or anyone in the community. Practically all the features on Flickr's various platforms -- web, mobile and desktop -- are accompanied by a longstanding API program. Since 2005, developers have collaborated on top of Flickr's APIs to build fun, creative, and gorgeous experiences around photos that extend beyond Flickr.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/\" target=_new>https://www.flickr.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>DNS resolve each identified domain.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_flickr:dns_resolve' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_flickr:maxpages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"20\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of seconds to pause between fetches.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_flickr:pause' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of results per page.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_flickr:per_page' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_focsec' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Focsec (sfp_focsec)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for looking up IP address information from Focsec.<br/><br/>Our API lets you know if a user's IP address is associated with a VPN, Proxy, TOR or malicious bots.Take your applications security to the next level by detecting suspicious activity early on.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://focsec.com/\" target=_new>https://focsec.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Focsec API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://focsec.com/signup'>https://focsec.com/signup</a></li><li>Register an account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://focsec.com/account/dashboard'>https://focsec.com/account/dashboard</a> and use the API key provided</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_focsec:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_fofa' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Fofa (sfp_fofa)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for querying Fofa API to look up domain, IP address, and other information.<br/><br/>Fofa is a search engine for Internet-connected devices and assets.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://fofa.info/\" target=_new>https://fofa.info/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fofa API email.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fofa:api_email' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fofa API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://fofa.info/user/register'>https://fofa.info/user/register</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://en.fofa.info/api'>https://en.fofa.info/api</a></li><li>Your API Key will be listed under 'API Key'.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fofa:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Limit results to assets discovered within this many days.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fofa:max_age_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_fortinet' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>FortiGuard Antispam (sfp_fortinet)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to check if an IP address is malicious according to FortiGuard Antispam.<br/><br/>FortiGuard Antispam provides a comprehensive and multi-layered approach to detect and filter spam processed by organizations.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.fortiguard.com/\" target=_new>https://www.fortiguard.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_fortinet:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_fraudguard' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Fraudguard (sfp_fraudguard)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for querying Fraudguard.io API.<br/><br/>FraudGuard is a service designed to provide an easy way to validate usage by continuously collecting and analyzing real-time internet traffic. Utilizing just a few simple API endpoints we make integration as simple as possible and return data such as: Risk Level, Threat Type, Geo Location, etc. Super fast, super simple.\nLookup any IP address by querying our threat engine.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://fraudguard.io/\" target=_new>https://fraudguard.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fraudguard:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"90\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_fraudguard:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fraudguard.io API username.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://app.fraudguard.io/register'>https://app.fraudguard.io/register</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://app.fraudguard.io/keys'>https://app.fraudguard.io/keys</a></li><li>The API key combination is listed under Username and Password</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fraudguard:fraudguard_api_key_account' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fraudguard.io API password.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://app.fraudguard.io/register'>https://app.fraudguard.io/register</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://app.fraudguard.io/keys'>https://app.fraudguard.io/keys</a></li><li>The API key combination is listed under Username and Password</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fraudguard:fraudguard_api_key_password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv4 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fraudguard:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum IPv4 subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fraudguard:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv6 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fraudguard:maxv6netblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum IPv6 subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fraudguard:maxv6subnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_fraudguard:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_fraudguard:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_fsecure_riddler' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>F-Secure Riddler.io (sfp_fsecure_riddler)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for querying F-Secure Riddler.io API.<br/><br/>Riddler.io allows you to search in a high quality dataset with more than 396,831,739 hostnames. Unlike others, we do not rely on simple port scanning techniques - we crawl the web, ensuring an in-depth quality data set you will not find anywhere else.\nUse Riddler to enumerate possible attack vectors during your pen-test or use the very same data to monitor potential threats before it is too late.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://riddler.io/\" target=_new>https://riddler.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>F-Secure Riddler.io password\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fsecure_riddler:password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>F-Secure Riddler.io username\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fsecure_riddler:username' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify host names resolve\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_fsecure_riddler:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_fullcontact' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>FullContact (sfp_fullcontact)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to gather domain and e-mail information from FullContact.com API.<br/><br/>Connecting data. Consolidating identities. Applying insights. Amplifying media reach. We provide person-centered identity resolution to improve your customer interactions with a simple, real-time API integration.\nFullContact is a privacy-safe Identity Resolution company building trust between people and brands. We deliver the capabilities needed to create tailored customer experiences by unifying data and applying insights in the moments that matter.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.fullcontact.com\" target=_new>https://www.fullcontact.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>FullContact.com API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://fullcontact.com'>https://fullcontact.com</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://dashboard.fullcontact.com'>https://dashboard.fullcontact.com</a></li><li>Click on 'Get an API Key'</li><li>Verify your account using your contact number</li><li>The API Key will be listed under 'Your API Keys'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fullcontact:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of age in days for a record before it's considered invalid and not reported.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fullcontact:max_age_days' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"365\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_fullhunt' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>FullHunt (sfp_fullhunt)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify domain attack surface using FullHunt API.<br/><br/>Discover, monitor, and secure your attack surface. FullHunt delivers the best platform in the market for attack surface security.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://fullhunt.io/\" target=_new>https://fullhunt.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>FullHunt API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://fullhunt.io/'>https://fullhunt.io/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://fullhunt.io/user/settings/'>https://fullhunt.io/user/settings/</a></li><li>Your API key is listed under 'API Access'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_fullhunt:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_github' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Github (sfp_github)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to identify public code repositories in Github associated with your target.<br/><br/>GitHub brings together the world's largest community of developers to discover, share, and build better software.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/\" target=_new>https://github.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Match repositories by name only, not by their descriptions. Helps reduce false positives.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_github:namesonly' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_gleif' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>GLEIF (sfp_gleif)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin for searching the Global LEI Index.<br/><br/>The Global Legal Entity Identifier Foundation (GLEIF) Global LEI Index contains historical and current LEI records including related reference data in one authoritative, central repository.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://search.gleif.org/\" target=_new>https://search.gleif.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_google_tag_manager' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Google Tag Manager (sfp_google_tag_manager)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plugin to search Google Tag Manager (GTM) for hosts sharing the same GTM code.<br/><br/>Manage all your website tags without editing code. Google Tag Manager delivers simple, reliable, easily integrated tag management solutions for free.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://tagmanager.google.com\" target=_new>https://tagmanager.google.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify identified hostnames resolve to an IP address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_google_tag_manager:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_googlemaps' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Google Maps (sfp_googlemaps)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Explore where real-world insights and immersive location experiences can take your business.\nBuild with reliable, comprehensive data for over 200 countries and territories.\nhas been done here. If line breaks are needed for breaking up\nScale confidently, backed by our infrastructure.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/maps-platform/\" target=_new>https://cloud.google.com/maps-platform/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google Geocoding API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://cloud.google.com/maps-platform/'>https://cloud.google.com/maps-platform/</a></li><li>Register a free Google account</li><li>Click on 'Get Started'</li><li>Click on 'API'</li><li>Select the type of API</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials'>https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials</a></li><li>Click on 'Credentials'</li><li>The API Key will be listed under 'API Keys'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_googlemaps:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_googleobjectstorage' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Google Object Storage Finder (sfp_googleobjectstorage)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Object storage for companies of all sizes.Secure, durable, and with low latency. Store any amount of data.Retrieve it as often as you'd like.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/storage\" target=_new>https://cloud.google.com/storage</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>List of suffixes to append to domains tried as bucket names\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_googleobjectstorage:suffixes' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"test,dev,web,beta,bucket,space,files,content,data,prod,staging,production,stage,app,media,development,-test,-dev,-web,-beta,-bucket,-space,-files,-content,-data,-prod,-staging,-production,-stage,-app,-media,-development\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_googlesafebrowsing' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Google SafeBrowsing (sfp_googlesafebrowsing)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The Safe Browsing APIs (v4) let your client applications check URLs against Google's constantly updated lists of unsafe web resources. Any URL found on a Safe Browsing list is considered unsafe.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow, apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/safe-browsing/v4/lookup-api\" target=_new>https://developers.google.com/safe-browsing/v4/lookup-api</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google Safe Browsing API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://console.developers.google.com/'>https://console.developers.google.com/</a></li><li>Register a free Google account or sign in</li><li>Create or select existing Google Developer Console project</li><li>Go to the Cloud Console API Library <a target=_new href='https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library'>https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library</a></li><li>From the projects list, select the project you want to use</li><li>In the API Library select 'Safe Browsing APIs'</li><li>On the API page, click ENABLE</li><li>Navigate to the APIs & Services→Credentials panel in Cloud Console</li><li>Select Create credentials, then select API key from the dropdown menu</li><li>The API key created dialog box displays your newly created key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_googlesafebrowsing:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_googlesearch' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Google (sfp_googlesearch)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Google Custom Search enables you to create a search engine for your website, your blog, or a collection of websites. You can configure your engine to search both web pages and images. You can fine-tune the ranking, add your own promotions and customize the look and feel of the search results. You can monetize the search by connecting your engine to your Google AdSense account.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/custom-search\" target=_new>https://developers.google.com/custom-search</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google API Key for Google search.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction'>https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction</a></li><li>Register a free Google account</li><li>Click on 'Get A Key'</li><li>Connect a Project</li><li>The API Key will be listed under 'YOUR API KEY'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_googlesearch:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google Custom Search Engine ID.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_googlesearch:cse_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"013611106330597893267:tfgl3wxdtbp\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_gravatar' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Gravatar (sfp_gravatar)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Your Gravatar is an image that follows you from site to site appearing beside your name when you do things like comment or post on a blog.\nA Gravatar is a Globally Recognized Avatar. You upload it and create your profile just once, and then when you participate in any Gravatar-enabled site, your Gravatar image will automatically follow you there.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/\" target=_new>https://secure.gravatar.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_grayhatwarfare' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Grayhat Warfare (sfp_grayhatwarfare)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>It is a searchable database of open buckets.Has up to million results of each bucket.Full text search with binary logic (can search for keywords and also stopwords)</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://buckets.grayhatwarfare.com/\" target=_new>https://buckets.grayhatwarfare.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Grayhat Warfare API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://grayhatwarfare.com/register'>https://grayhatwarfare.com/register</a></li><li>Register an account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://grayhatwarfare.com/account/settings'>https://grayhatwarfare.com/account/settings</a></li><li>Your API key is listed under 'Api Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_grayhatwarfare:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_grayhatwarfare:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of seconds to wait between each API call.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_grayhatwarfare:pause' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of results per page (Max: 1000).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_grayhatwarfare:per_page' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1000\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_greensnow' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Greensnow (sfp_greensnow)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>GreenSnow is a team consisting of the best specialists in computer security, we harvest a large number of IPs from different computers located around the world. GreenSnow is comparable with SpamHaus.org for attacks of any kind except for spam. Our list is updated automatically and you can withdraw at any time your IP address if it has been listed.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://greensnow.co/\" target=_new>https://greensnow.co/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_greensnow:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliate IP addresses?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_greensnow:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_greensnow:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_greensnow:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_grep_app' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>grep.app (sfp_grep_app)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>grep.app searches code from over a half million public repositories on GitHub.\nIt searches for the exact string you enter, including any punctuation or other characters.\nYou can also search by regular expression, using the RE2 syntax.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://grep.app/\" target=_new>https://grep.app/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>DNS resolve each identified domain.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_grep_app:dns_resolve' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_grep_app:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"20\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_greynoise' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>GreyNoise (sfp_greynoise)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>At GreyNoise, we collect and analyze untargeted, widespread, and opportunistic scan and attack activity that reaches every server directly connected to the Internet. Mass scanners (such as Shodan and Censys), search engines, bots, worms, and crawlers generate logs and events omnidirectionally on every IP address in the IPv4 space. GreyNoise gives you the ability to filter this useless noise out.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://greynoise.io/\" target=_new>https://greynoise.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_greynoise:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>GreyNoise API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://viz.greynoise.io/signup'>https://viz.greynoise.io/signup</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://viz.greynoise.io/account'>https://viz.greynoise.io/account</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_greynoise:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_greynoise:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_greynoise:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_greynoise:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_greynoise:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_greynoise_community' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>GreyNoise Community (sfp_greynoise_community)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>At GreyNoise, we collect and analyze untargeted, widespread, and opportunistic scan and attack activity that reaches every server directly connected to the Internet. Mass scanners (such as Shodan and Censys), search engines, bots, worms, and crawlers generate logs and events omnidirectionally on every IP address in the IPv4 space. GreyNoise gives you the ability to filter this useless noise out.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://greynoise.io/\" target=_new>https://greynoise.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_greynoise_community:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>GreyNoise Community API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://viz.greynoise.io/signup'>https://viz.greynoise.io/signup</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://viz.greynoise.io/account/'>https://viz.greynoise.io/account/</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_greynoise_community:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_h1nobbdde' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>HackerOne (Unofficial) (sfp_h1nobbdde)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Unofficial Bug Monitoring platform for HackerOne.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://www.nobbd.de/\" target=_new>http://www.nobbd.de/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_hackertarget' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>HackerTarget (sfp_hackertarget)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Simplify the security assessment process with hosted vulnerability scanners. From attack surface discovery to vulnerability identification, actionable network intelligence for IT & security operations. Proactively hunt for security weakness. Pivot from attack surface discovery to vulnerability identification.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://hackertarget.com/\" target=_new>https://hackertarget.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_hackertarget:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Retrieve IP HTTP headers using HackerTarget.com\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_hackertarget:http_headers' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_hackertarget:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_hackertarget:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_hackertarget:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_hackertarget:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_hashes' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Hash Extractor (sfp_hashes)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_haveibeenpwned' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>HaveIBeenPwned (sfp_haveibeenpwned)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Check if you have an account that has been compromised in a data breach.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://haveibeenpwned.com/\" target=_new>https://haveibeenpwned.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>HaveIBeenPwned.com API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://haveibeenpwned.com/API/Key'>https://haveibeenpwned.com/API/Key</a></li><li>Register an account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://haveibeenpwned.com/API/Key'>https://haveibeenpwned.com/API/Key</a></li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_haveibeenpwned:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_honeypot' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Project Honey Pot (sfp_honeypot)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Project Honey Pot is the first and only distributed system for identifying spammers and the spambots they use to scrape addresses from your website. Using the Project Honey Pot system you can install addresses that are custom-tagged to the time and IP address of a visitor to your site. If one of these addresses begins receiving email we not only can tell that the messages are spam, but also the exact moment when the address was harvested and the IP address that gathered it.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.projecthoneypot.org/\" target=_new>https://www.projecthoneypot.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>ProjectHoneyPot.org API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.projecthoneypot.org'>https://www.projecthoneypot.org</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://www.projecthoneypot.org/httpbl_configure.php''>https://www.projecthoneypot.org/httpbl_configure.php'</a></li><li>Request for an API key</li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your http:BL Access Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_honeypot:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_honeypot:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_honeypot:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_honeypot:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Include entries considered search engines?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_honeypot:searchengine' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_honeypot:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Threat score minimum, 0 being everything and 255 being only the most serious.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_honeypot:threatscore' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum days old an entry can be. 255 is the maximum, 0 means you'll get nothing.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_honeypot:timelimit' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_hosting' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Hosting Provider Identifier (sfp_hosting)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_hostio' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Host.io (sfp_hostio)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>We collect data on every known domain name, from every TLD, and update it every month. Our data includes DNS records and website data for each of the domains.We process terabytes of data and summarize it to produce our final results. Browse through our site to see backlinks, redirects, server details or IP address and hosting provider details courtesy of IPinfo.io.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://host.io\" target=_new>https://host.io</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Host.io API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://host.io/signup'>https://host.io/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://host.io/dashboard'>https://host.io/dashboard</a> and use the authentication token provided</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_hostio:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_hunter' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Hunter.io (sfp_hunter)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Hunter lets you find email addresses in seconds and connect with the people that matter for your business.\nThe Domain Search lists all the people working in a company with their name and email address found on the web. With 100+ million email addresses indexed, effective search filters and scoring, it's the most powerful email-finding tool ever created.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://hunter.io/\" target=_new>https://hunter.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hunter.io API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://hunter.io/'>https://hunter.io/</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Click on 'Account Settings'</li><li>Click on 'API'</li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_hunter:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_hybrid_analysis' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Hybrid Analysis (sfp_hybrid_analysis)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>A free malware analysis service for the community. Using this service you can submit files for in-depth static and dynamic analysis.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.hybrid-analysis.com\" target=_new>https://www.hybrid-analysis.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hybrid Analysis API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.hybrid-analysis.com/signup'>https://www.hybrid-analysis.com/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://www.hybrid-analysis.com/my-account?tab=%23api-key-tab'>https://www.hybrid-analysis.com/my-account?tab=%23api-key-tab</a></li><li>Create an API Key</li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_hybrid_analysis:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_hybrid_analysis:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify identified domains still resolve to the associated specified IP address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_hybrid_analysis:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_iban' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>IBAN Number Extractor (sfp_iban)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>errorprone</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_iknowwhatyoudownload' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Iknowwhatyoudownload.com (sfp_iknowwhatyoudownload)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Our system collects torrent files in two ways: parsing torrent sites, and listening DHT network. The system contains more than 7 million torrents (as of Oct 2021) which were classified and which are using now for collecting peer sharing facts (up to 200.000.000 daily).</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Secondary Networks</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://iknowwhatyoudownload.com/en/peer/\" target=_new>https://iknowwhatyoudownload.com/en/peer/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Iknowwhatyoudownload.com API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://iknowwhatyoudownload.com/en/api/'>https://iknowwhatyoudownload.com/en/api/</a></li><li>Request Demo Key with email id</li><li>The API key will be sent to your email</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_iknowwhatyoudownload:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>How far back (in days) to look for activity.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_iknowwhatyoudownload:daysback' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_instagram' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Instagram Monitor (sfp_instagram)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Instagram API access token.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_instagram:access_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of posts/stories to fetch per user.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_instagram:max_items' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Instagram usernames.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_instagram:usernames' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_intelx' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>IntelligenceX (sfp_intelx)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Intelligence X is an independent European technology company founded in 2018 by Peter Kleissner. Its mission is to develop and maintain the search engine and data archive.\nThe search works with selectors, i.e. specific search terms such as email addresses, domains, URLs, IPs, CIDRs, Bitcoin addresses, IPFS hashes, etc.\nIt searches in places such as the darknet, document sharing platforms, whois data, public data leaks and others.\nIt keeps a historical data archive of results, similar to how the Wayback Machine from archive.org stores historical copies of websites.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://intelx.io/\" target=_new>https://intelx.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>IntelligenceX API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://intelx.io/'>https://intelx.io/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://intelx.io/account?tab=developer'>https://intelx.io/account?tab=developer</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your API details'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_intelx:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>API URL, as provided in your IntelligenceX account settings.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_intelx:base_url' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2.intelx.io\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_intelx:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check co-hosted sites?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_intelx:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum age (in days) of results to be considered valid. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_intelx:maxage' class='form-control' type=text value=\"90\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_intelx:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_intelx:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_intelx:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_intelx:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_intfiles' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Interesting File Finder (sfp_intfiles)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>File extensions of files you consider interesting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_intfiles:fileexts' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"doc,docx,ppt,pptx,pdf,xls,xlsx,zip\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ipapico' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ipapi.co (sfp_ipapico)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Powerful & Simple REST API for IP Address Geolocation.ipapi.co provides a REST API to find the location of an IP address.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://ipapi.co/\" target=_new>https://ipapi.co/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ipapicom' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ipapi.com (sfp_ipapicom)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>ipapi provides an easy-to-use API interface allowing customers to look various pieces of information IPv4 and IPv6 addresses are associated with. For each IP address processed, the API returns more than 45 unique data points, such as location data, connection data, ISP information, time zone, currency and security assessment data.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://ipapi.com/\" target=_new>https://ipapi.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>ipapi.com API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://ipapi.com/'>https://ipapi.com/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Browse to <a target=_new href='https://ipapi.com/dashboard'>https://ipapi.com/dashboard</a></li><li>Your API Key will be listed under Your API Access Key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ipapicom:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ipinfo' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>IPInfo.io (sfp_ipinfo)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The Trusted Source for IP Address Data.\nWith IPinfo, you can pinpoint your users’ locations, customize their experiences, prevent fraud, ensure compliance, and so much more.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://ipinfo.io\" target=_new>https://ipinfo.io</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ipinfo.io access token.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://ipinfo.io/'>https://ipinfo.io/</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://ipinfo.io/account'>https://ipinfo.io/account</a></li><li>The API key is listed above 'is your access token'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ipinfo:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ipqualityscore' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>IPQualityScore (sfp_ipqualityscore)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>IPQualityScore's suite of fraud prevention tools automate quality control to prevent bots, fake accounts, fraudsters, suspicious transactions, & malicious users without interrupting the user experience.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.ipqualityscore.com/\" target=_new>https://www.ipqualityscore.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum abuse score for target to be considered malicious (0 - 100)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ipqualityscore:abuse_score_threshold' class='form-control' type=text value=\"85\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>IPQualityScore API Key\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.ipqualityscore.com/'>https://www.ipqualityscore.com/</a></li><li>Click on 'Plans'</li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.ipqualityscore.com/user/settings'>https://www.ipqualityscore.com/user/settings</a></li><li>Your API key will be listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ipqualityscore:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Depth of the reputation checks to be performed on the target (0 - 2)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ipqualityscore:strictness' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ipregistry' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ipregistry (sfp_ipregistry)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Ipregistry is a trusted and in-depth IP Geolocation and Threat detections source of information that canbenefit publishers, ad networks, retailers, financial services, e-commerce stores and more.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://ipregistry.co/\" target=_new>https://ipregistry.co/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ipregistry API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://dashboard.ipregistry.co/signup'>https://dashboard.ipregistry.co/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Click on 'API Keys' in left navbar</li><li>Click on 'Click to reveal API key' for existing Default key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ipregistry:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ipstack' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ipstack (sfp_ipstack)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Locate and identify website visitors by IP address.\nipstack offers one of the leading IP to geolocation APIS and global IP database services worldwide.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://ipstack.com/\" target=_new>https://ipstack.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ipstack.com API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://ipstack.com/product'>https://ipstack.com/product</a></li><li>Click on 'Get Free API Key'</li><li>Click on 'Dashboard'</li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your API Access Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_ipstack:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_isc' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Internet Storm Center (sfp_isc)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The ISC provides a free analysis and warning service to thousands of Internet users and organizations, and is actively working with Internet Service Providers to fight back against the most malicious attackers.\nThousands of sensors that work with most firewalls, intrusion detection systems, home broadband devices, and nearly all operating systems are constantly collecting information about unwanted traffic arriving from the Internet. These devices feed the DShield database where human volunteers as well as machines pour through the data looking for abnormal trends and behavior. The resulting analysis is posted to the ISC's main web page where it can be automatically retrieved by simple scripts or can be viewed in near real time by any Internet user.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://isc.sans.edu\" target=_new>https://isc.sans.edu</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_isc:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_jsonwhoiscom' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>JsonWHOIS.com (sfp_jsonwhoiscom)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Get access to accurate Whois records for generic and country TLDs. Around 1000 gTLDs include .com, .org, .net, .us, .biz, .info, .mobi, .pro, .asia and many other new ones.\nRaw and parsed Whois data are both accessible for downloads in the form of MYSQL or MYSQL database dumps and Comma Separated Values (.CSV) files.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://jsonwhois.com\" target=_new>https://jsonwhois.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>JsonWHOIS.com API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://jsonwhois.com'>https://jsonwhois.com</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://jsonwhois.com/dashboard'>https://jsonwhois.com/dashboard</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'Api Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_jsonwhoiscom:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_jsonwhoiscom:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_junkfiles' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Junk File Finder (sfp_junkfiles)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow, errorprone, invasive</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Try to fetch the containing folder with these extensions.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_junkfiles:dirs' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"zip,tar.gz,tgz,tar\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>File extensions to try.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_junkfiles:fileexts' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"tmp,bak,old\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Try to fetch each of these files from the directory of the URL.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_junkfiles:files' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"old,passwd,.htaccess,.htpasswd,Thumbs.db,backup\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Try those extensions against URLs with these extensions.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_junkfiles:urlextstry' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"asp,php,jsp\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_keybase' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Keybase (sfp_keybase)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Keybase is a key directory that maps social media identities to encryption keys in a publicly auditable manner.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://keybase.io/\" target=_new>https://keybase.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_koodous' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Koodous (sfp_koodous)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The Collaborative Platform for Android Malware Analysts.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://koodous.com/apks/\" target=_new>https://koodous.com/apks/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Koodous API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://koodous.com/apks'>https://koodous.com/apks</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://koodous.com/settings/developers'>https://koodous.com/settings/developers</a> and use the authentication token provided</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_koodous:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_koodous:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_leakcheck' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>LeakCheck.io (sfp_leakcheck)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>LeakCheck offers a search engine with a database of more than 9 billion leaked records. Users can search for leaked information using email addresses, usernames, phone numbers, keywords, and domain names. Our goal is to safeguard the data of people and companies.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://leakcheck.io/\" target=_new>https://leakcheck.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>LeakCheck API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://leakcheck.io'>https://leakcheck.io</a></li><li>Register for an account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://leakcheck.io/settings'>https://leakcheck.io/settings</a></li><li>Create your API key there</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_leakcheck:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of seconds to wait between each API call.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_leakcheck:pause' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_leakix' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>LeakIX (sfp_leakix)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>LeakIX provides insights into devices and servers that are compromised and compromised database schemas online.\nIn this scope we inspect found services for weak credentials.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://leakix.net/\" target=_new>https://leakix.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>LeakIX API key\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://leakix.net/'>https://leakix.net/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Go to your 'Settings'</li><li>Click on 'API key'</li><li>Click on 'Reset key' to generate a new key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_leakix:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_leakix:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify discovered hostnames are valid by checking if they still resolve.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_leakix:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_luminar' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Luminar (sfp_luminar)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Luminar provides real-time threat intelligence powered by machine learning. Their API allows you to query and obtain information about threats.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.luminar.com/\" target=_new>https://www.luminar.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Luminar API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.luminar.com/'>https://www.luminar.com/</a></li><li>Register for an account</li><li>Navigate to the API section</li><li>Generate an API key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_luminar:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify host names resolve\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_luminar:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_maltiverse' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Maltiverse (sfp_maltiverse)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The Open IOC Search Engine.\nEnhance your SIEM or Firewall and crosscheck your event data with top quality Threat Intelligence information to highlight what requires action.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://maltiverse.com\" target=_new>https://maltiverse.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_maltiverse:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_maltiverse:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_maltiverse:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_maltiverse:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_maltiverse:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_maltiverse:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_malwarepatrol' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>MalwarePatrol (sfp_malwarepatrol)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Based in the USA and Brazil, our history is one of community spirit and dedication to Internet security that began in 2005 when a group started sharing malicious links using a simple mailing list.\nCollecting, analyzing, and sharing data for over a decade has allowed us to develop an extensive network of sensors, sharing agreements, and community contributors. The result is our vast database of unique and historically rich – “intelligent” – threat data.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.malwarepatrol.net/\" target=_new>https://www.malwarepatrol.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Malwarepatrol.com 'receipt' ID, provided once signing up for their open-source feed. Without this you cannot obtain their feed.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.malwarepatrol.net/free-guard-block-list/'>https://www.malwarepatrol.net/free-guard-block-list/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>The Password/Receipt number will be mailed to your email</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_malwarepatrol:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_malwarepatrol:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_malwarepatrol:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_mandiant_ti' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Mandiant Threat Intelligence (sfp_mandiant_ti)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Mandiant Threat Intelligence provides real-time threat intelligence powered by machine learning. Their API allows you to query and obtain information about threats.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.mandiant.com/\" target=_new>https://www.mandiant.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Mandiant Threat Intelligence API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.mandiant.com/'>https://www.mandiant.com/</a></li><li>Register for an account</li><li>Navigate to the API section</li><li>Generate an API key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mandiant_ti:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify host names resolve\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_mandiant_ti:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_mastodon' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Mastodon Monitor (sfp_mastodon)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Mastodon access token.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mastodon:access_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., post,reply,boost).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mastodon:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"post,reply,boost\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Mastodon instance URL.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mastodon:instance_url' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of posts to fetch per user.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mastodon:max_posts' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mastodon:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Timestamp or token for incremental sync (empty for full history).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mastodon:since' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Mastodon username to monitor.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mastodon:username' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_matrix' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Matrix Server Monitor (sfp_matrix)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Matrix access token.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_matrix:access_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., message,join,leave).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_matrix:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"message,join,leave\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Matrix homeserver URL.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_matrix:homeserver' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"https://matrix.org\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per room.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_matrix:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_matrix:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Matrix room ID to monitor.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_matrix:room_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Token for incremental sync (empty for full history).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_matrix:since' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_mattermost' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Mattermost Server Monitor (sfp_mattermost)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Mattermost access token.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mattermost:access_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Mattermost channel ID to monitor.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mattermost:channel_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., message,join,leave).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mattermost:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"message,join,leave\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per channel.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mattermost:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mattermost:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Mattermost server URL.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mattermost:server_url' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Timestamp or token for incremental sync (empty for full history).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mattermost:since' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_metadefender' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>MetaDefender (sfp_metadefender)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>File Analysis - Analyzing binaries with 30+ anti-malware engines.\nHeuristic analysis to detect more unknown and targeted attacks.\nBinary vulnerability data assessment, IP/Domain reputation, Threat Intelligence Feeds</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://metadefender.opswat.com/\" target=_new>https://metadefender.opswat.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>MetaDefender API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://metadefender.opswat.com/'>https://metadefender.opswat.com/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://metadefender.opswat.com/account'>https://metadefender.opswat.com/account</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_metadefender:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_metadefender:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"6\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_mnemonic' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Mnemonic PassiveDNS (sfp_mnemonic)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>mnemonic helps businesses manage their security risks, protect their data and defend against cyber threats.\nOur expert team of security consultants, product specialists, threat researchers, incident responders and ethical hackers, combined with our Argus security platform ensures we stay ahead of advanced cyberattacks and protect our customers from evolving threats.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.mnemonic.no\" target=_new>https://www.mnemonic.no</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_mnemonic:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mnemonic:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The maximum age of the data returned, in days, in order to be considered valid.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mnemonic:maxage' class='form-control' type=text value=\"180\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mnemonic:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of results per page.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mnemonic:per_page' class='form-control' type=text value=\"500\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query timeout, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_mnemonic:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify identified domains still resolve to the associated specified IP address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_mnemonic:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_multiproxy' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>multiproxy.org Open Proxies (sfp_multiproxy)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>MultiProxy is a multifunctional personal proxy server that protects your privacy while on the Internet as well as speeds up your downloads, especially if you are trying to get several files form overseas or from otherwise rather slow server. It can also completely hide your IP address by dynamically connecting to non-transparent anonymizing public proxy servers. You can also test a list of proxy servers and sort them by connection speed and level of anonimity.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Secondary Networks</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://multiproxy.org/\" target=_new>https://multiproxy.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_multiproxy:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_multiproxy:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_myspace' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>MySpace (sfp_myspace)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Myspace is a place where people come to connect, discover, and share.\nThrough an open design, compelling editorial features, and analytics-based recommendations, Myspace creates a creative community of people who connect around mutual affinity and inspiration for the purpose of shaping, sharing, and discovering what's next.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://myspace.com/\" target=_new>https://myspace.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_nameapi' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>NameAPI (sfp_nameapi)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The NameAPI DEA-Detector checks email addresses against a list of known trash domains such as mailinator.com.\nIt classifies those as disposable which operate as a time-limited, web based way of receiving emails, for example, sign up confirmations.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.nameapi.org/\" target=_new>https://www.nameapi.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>API Key for NameAPI\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://nameapi.org'>https://nameapi.org</a></li><li>Click on 'Get API Key'</li><li>Register a free account</li><li>The API key will be sent to your email</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_nameapi:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_names' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Human Name Extractor (sfp_names)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>errorprone</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>A value between 0-100 to tune the sensitivity of the name finder. Less than 40 will give you a lot of junk, over 50 and you'll probably miss things but will have less false positives.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_names:algolimit' class='form-control' type=text value=\"75\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Convert e-mail addresses in the form of firstname.surname@target to names?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_names:emailtoname' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Filter out names that originated from CSS/JS content. Enabling this avoids detection of popular Javascript and web framework author names.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_names:filterjscss' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_netlas' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Netlas (sfp_netlas)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>SpiderFoot plug-in for searching Netlas API for domain, IP address, and\n    other information.\n\n    This class is responsible for querying Netlas API to retrieve\n    information about domains, IP addresses, and other related data.\n    <br/><br/>Netlas provides powerful APIs to help you enrich any user experience or automate any workflow.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://netlas.io/\" target=_new>https://netlas.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Netlas API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://netlas.io/signup'>https://netlas.io/signup</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://netlas.io/api/'>https://netlas.io/api/</a></li><li>Your API Key will be listed under 'API Key'.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_netlas:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_networksdb' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>NetworksDB (sfp_networksdb)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Our database contains information about the public IPv4 and IPv6 addresses, networks and domains owned by companies and organisations across the world along with city-level IP geolocation data and autonomous system information.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://networksdb.io/\" target=_new>https://networksdb.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>NetworksDB API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://networksdb.io/api/order/free'>https://networksdb.io/api/order/free</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Click on 'Generate a Free API Key'</li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key: Free plan'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_networksdb:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_networksdb:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_networksdb:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_networksdb:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_networksdb:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_neutrinoapi' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>NeutrinoAPI (sfp_neutrinoapi)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Neutrino API - The general-purpose API - Build smarter applications.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.neutrinoapi.com/\" target=_new>https://www.neutrinoapi.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>NeutrinoAPI API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.neutrinoapi.com/'>https://www.neutrinoapi.com/</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Click on 'My Account'</li><li>The API key is listed under 'Master Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_neutrinoapi:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query timeout, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_neutrinoapi:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>NeutrinoAPI user ID.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_neutrinoapi:user_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_numverify' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>numverify (sfp_numverify)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Global Phone Number Validation & Lookup JSON API.\nNumVerify offers a full-featured yet simple RESTful JSON API for national and international phone number validation and information lookup for a total of 232 countries around the world.\nRequested numbers are processed in real-time, cross-checked with the latest international numbering plan databases and returned in handy JSON format enriched with useful carrier, geographical location and line type data.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://numverify.com/\" target=_new>http://numverify.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>numverify API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://numverify.com'>https://numverify.com</a></li><li>Sign up for a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://numverify.com/dashboard'>https://numverify.com/dashboard</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your API Access Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_numverify:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_onioncity' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Onion.link (sfp_onioncity)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Enabling search and global access to Tor's onionsites.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey, tor</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://onion.link/\" target=_new>https://onion.link/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google API Key for Onion.link search.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction'>https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction</a></li><li>Register a free Google account</li><li>Click on 'Get A Key'</li><li>Connect a Project</li><li>The API Key will be listed under 'YOUR API KEY'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onioncity:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google Custom Search Engine ID.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onioncity:cse_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"013611106330597893267:tfgl3wxdtbp\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fetch the darknet pages (via TOR, if enabled) to verify they mention your target.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_onioncity:fetchlinks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Search for human names?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_onioncity:fullnames' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_onionsearchengine' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Onionsearchengine.com (sfp_onionsearchengine)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>No cookies, no javascript, no trace. We protect your privacy.\nOnion search engine is search engine with ability to find content on tor network / deepweb / darkweb.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tor</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://as.onionsearchengine.com\" target=_new>https://as.onionsearchengine.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Exclude results from sites matching these patterns.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onionsearchengine:blacklist' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\".*://relate.*\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fetch the darknet pages (via TOR, if enabled) to verify they mention your target.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_onionsearchengine:fetchlinks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Search for human names?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_onionsearchengine:fullnames' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onionsearchengine:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"20\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query timeout, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onionsearchengine:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_onyphe' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Onyphe (sfp_onyphe)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>ONYPHE is a search engine for open-source and cyber threat intelligence data collected by crawling various sources available on the Internet or by listening to Internet background noise. They make this data available through API that we use. We check their data to see following information about the IP: geo-location, does it have some vulnerabilities, is it on some pastries (PasteBin) and is it on their threat list</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.onyphe.io\" target=_new>https://www.onyphe.io</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onyphe:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Onyphe access token.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.onyphe.io/login/#register'>https://www.onyphe.io/login/#register</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>You should receive your API key on your email, or you can get it by yourself following next steps</li><li>Go to your account settings <a target=_new href='https://www.onyphe.io/auth/account'>https://www.onyphe.io/auth/account</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onyphe:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_onyphe:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages to iterate through. Onyphe has a maximum of 1000 pages (10,000 results). Only matters for paid plans\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onyphe:max_page' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_onyphe:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Are you using paid plan? Paid plan has pagination enabled\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_onyphe:paid_plan' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify identified domains still resolve to the associated specified IP address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_onyphe:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_openbugbounty' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Open Bug Bounty (sfp_openbugbounty)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Open Bug Bounty is an open, disintermediated, cost-free, and community-driven bug bounty platform for coordinated, responsible and ISO 29147 compatible vulnerability disclosure.\nThe role of Open Bug Bounty is limited to independent verification of the submitted vulnerabilities and proper notification of website owners by all available means. Once notified, the website owner and the researcher are in direct contact to remediate the vulnerability and coordinate its disclosure. At this and at any later stages, we never act as an intermediary between website owners and security researchers.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.openbugbounty.org/\" target=_new>https://www.openbugbounty.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_opencorporates' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>OpenCorporates (sfp_opencorporates)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The largest open database of companies in the world.\nAs the largest, open database of companies in the world, our business is making high-quality, official company data openly available. Data that can be trusted, accessed, analysed and interrogated when and how it’s needed.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://opencorporates.com\" target=_new>https://opencorporates.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>OpenCorporates.com API key. Without this you will be limited to 50 look-ups per day.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://opencorporates.com/api_accounts/newRegister'>https://opencorporates.com/api_accounts/newRegister</a> a new account with an email</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://opencorporates.com/users/account'>https://opencorporates.com/users/account</a> and select 'Get Account'</li><li>Select the plan required</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://opencorporates.com/users/account'>https://opencorporates.com/users/account</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Account'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_opencorporates:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Confidence that the search result objects are correct (numeric value between 0 and 100).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_opencorporates:confidence' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_opendns' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>OpenDNS (sfp_opendns)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Cisco Umbrella provides protection against threats on the internet such as malware, phishing, and ransomware.\nOpenDNS is a suite of consumer products aimed at making your internet faster, safer, and more reliable. FamilyShield is the single easiest way to protect your kids online, block adult websites, and protect your family from phishing and malware.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.opendns.com/\" target=_new>https://www.opendns.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_opennic' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>OpenNIC DNS (sfp_opennic)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>An organization of hobbyists who run an alternative DNS network, also provides access to domains not administered by ICANN.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.opennic.org/\" target=_new>https://www.opennic.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_opennic:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_openphish' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>OpenPhish (sfp_openphish)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Timely. Accurate. Relevant Threat Intelligence.\nOpenPhish is a fully automated self-contained platform for phishing intelligence. It identifies phishing sites and performs intelligence analysis in real time without human intervention and without using any external resources, such as blacklists.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://openphish.com/\" target=_new>https://openphish.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_openphish:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_openphish:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_openphish:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_openstreetmap' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>OpenStreetMap (sfp_openstreetmap)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>OpenStreetMap powers map data on thousands of web sites, mobile apps, and hardware devices.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/\" target=_new>https://www.openstreetmap.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_openwifimap' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>OpenWifiMap.net Lookup (sfp_openwifimap)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>City to filter results.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_openwifimap:city' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Country to filter results.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_openwifimap:country' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of hotspots to return.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_openwifimap:max_results' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_openwifimap:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Term to search for (SSID, BSSID, location, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_openwifimap:search_term' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_pageinfo' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Page Information (sfp_pageinfo)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_pastebin' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>PasteBin (sfp_pastebin)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Pastebin is a website where you can store any text online for easy sharing. The website is mainly used by programmers to store pieces of source code or configuration information, but anyone is more than welcome to paste any type of text. The idea behind the site is to make it more convenient for people to share large amounts of text online.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://pastebin.com/\" target=_new>https://pastebin.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google API Key for PasteBin search.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction'>https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction</a></li><li>Register a free Google account</li><li>Click on 'Get A Key'</li><li>Connect a Project</li><li>The API Key will be listed under 'YOUR API KEY'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pastebin:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google Custom Search Engine ID.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pastebin:cse_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"013611106330597893267:tfgl3wxdtbp\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_performance_optimizer' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Performance Optimizer (sfp_performance_optimizer)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>Performance optimization and caching system for SpiderFoot.<br/><br/>Internal performance optimization system.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"N/A\" target=_new>N/A</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable automatic garbage collection\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_performance_optimizer:auto_gc_enabled' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Base delay between requests (seconds)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Time to wait before flushing incomplete batch\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of requests per batch\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_performance_optimizer:batch_size' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Default cache TTL in seconds\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_performance_optimizer:cache_ttl_seconds' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3600\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable intelligent caching system\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_performance_optimizer:enable_caching' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable adaptive rate limiting\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_performance_optimizer:enable_rate_limiting' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable request batching optimization\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_performance_optimizer:enable_request_batching' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Monitor system resource usage\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_performance_optimizer:enable_resource_monitoring' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of cached items\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_performance_optimizer:max_cache_size' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10000\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum delay between requests (seconds)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Memory threshold for cleanup (MB)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_performance_optimizer:memory_cleanup_threshold_mb' class='form-control' type=text value=\"500\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_pgp' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>PGP Key Servers (sfp_pgp)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>PGP public key server URL to find the public key for an e-mail address. Email address will get appended.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pgp:keyserver_fetch1' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"https://keyserver.ubuntu.com/pks/lookup?op=get&search=\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Backup PGP public key server URL to find the public key for an e-mail address. Email address will get appended.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pgp:keyserver_fetch2' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"http://the.earth.li:11371/pks/lookup?op=get&search=\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>PGP public key server URL to find e-mail addresses on a domain. Domain will get appended.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pgp:keyserver_search1' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"https://keyserver.ubuntu.com/pks/lookup?fingerprint=on&op=vindex&search=\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Backup PGP public key server URL to find e-mail addresses on a domain. Domain will get appended.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pgp:keyserver_search2' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"http://the.earth.li:11371/pks/lookup?fingerprint=on&op=vindex&search=\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Retrieve PGP keys.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_pgp:retrieve_keys' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_phishstats' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>PhishStats (sfp_phishstats)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>PhishStats is a real time Phishing database that gathers phishing URLs from several sources.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://phishstats.info/\" target=_new>https://phishstats.info/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_phishstats:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_phishstats:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_phishstats:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_phishstats:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_phishstats:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_phishtank' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>PhishTank (sfp_phishtank)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Submit suspected phishes. Track the status of your submissions. Verify other users' submissions.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://phishtank.com/\" target=_new>https://phishtank.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_phishtank:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_phishtank:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_phishtank:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_phone' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Phone Number Extractor (sfp_phone)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_portscan_tcp' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Port Scanner - TCP (sfp_portscan_tcp)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow, invasive</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of ports to try to open simultaneously (number of threads to spawn at once.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_portscan_tcp:maxthreads' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Port scan all IPs within identified owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_portscan_tcp:netblockscan' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum netblock/subnet size to scan IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_portscan_tcp:netblockscanmax' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The TCP ports to scan. Prefix with an '@' to iterate through a file containing ports to try (one per line), e.g. @C:\\ports.txt or @/home/bob/ports.txt. Or supply a URL to load the list from there.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_portscan_tcp:ports' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"21,22,23,25,53,79,80,81,88,110,111,113,119,123,137,138,139,143,161,179,389,443,445,465,512,513,514,515,3306,5432,1521,2638,1433,3389,5900,5901,5902,5903,5631,631,636,990,992,993,995,1080,8080,8888,9000\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Randomize the order of ports scanned.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_portscan_tcp:randomize' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Seconds before giving up on a port.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_portscan_tcp:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"15\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_projectdiscovery' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ProjectDiscovery Chaos (sfp_projectdiscovery)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Projectdiscovery Chaos actively collect and maintain internet-wide assets' data, this project is meant to enhance research and analyse changes around DNS for better insights. </td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://chaos.projectdiscovery.io\" target=_new>https://chaos.projectdiscovery.io</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>chaos.projectdiscovery.io API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://chaos.projectdiscovery.io/#/'>https://chaos.projectdiscovery.io/#/</a></li><li>Click the request access button</li><li>Click the 'Early signup form' link or go to <a target=_new href='https://forms.gle/GP5nTamxJPfiMaBn9'>https://forms.gle/GP5nTamxJPfiMaBn9</a></li><li>Click on 'Developer'</li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your API Key'</li><li>You will receive your API key by email.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_projectdiscovery:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify that any hostnames found on the target domain still resolve?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_projectdiscovery:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_psbdmp' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Psbdmp (sfp_psbdmp)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Pastebin dump security monitor.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://psbdmp.cc/\" target=_new>https://psbdmp.cc/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_pulsedive' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Pulsedive (sfp_pulsedive)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Why check 30 different solutions for varying snippets of data when you can just check one? Pulsedive enriches IOCs but also fetches article summaries from Wikipedia and even posts from Reddit and the infosec blogosphere to provide contextual information for threats.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://pulsedive.com/\" target=_new>https://pulsedive.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pulsedive:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Pulsedive API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://pulsedive.com'>https://pulsedive.com</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://pulsedive.com/account'>https://pulsedive.com/account</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pulsedive:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_pulsedive:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pulsedive:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv4 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pulsedive:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum IPv4 subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pulsedive:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv6 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pulsedive:maxv6netblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum IPv6 subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_pulsedive:maxv6subnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_pulsedive:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_pulsedive:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_punkspider' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>PunkSpider (sfp_punkspider)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The idea behind Punkspider is very simple - we're doing a bunch of complicated stuff to find insecurities in massive amounts of websites, with the goal of scanning the entire Internet.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://punkspider.io/\" target=_new>https://punkspider.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_quad9' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Quad9 (sfp_quad9)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Quad9 brings together cyber threat intelligence about malicious domains from a variety of public and private sources and blocks access to those malicious domains when your system attempts to contact them.\nWhen you use Quad9, attackers and malware cannot leverage the known malicious domains to control your systems, and their ability to steal your data or cause harm will be hindered. Quad9 is an effective and easy way to add an additional layer of security to your infrastructure for free.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://quad9.net/\" target=_new>https://quad9.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_recordedfuture' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Recorded Future (sfp_recordedfuture)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Recorded Future provides real-time threat intelligence powered by machine learning. Their Vulnerability Database API allows you to query and obtain information about vulnerabilities.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.recordedfuture.com/\" target=_new>https://www.recordedfuture.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Recorded Future API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.recordedfuture.com/'>https://www.recordedfuture.com/</a></li><li>Register for an account</li><li>Navigate to the API section</li><li>Generate an API key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_recordedfuture:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify host names resolve\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_recordedfuture:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_reddit' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Reddit Monitor (sfp_reddit)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Reddit API client ID.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_reddit:client_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Reddit API client secret.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_reddit:client_secret' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of posts to fetch per subreddit.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_reddit:max_posts' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of subreddit names.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_reddit:subreddits' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_reversewhois' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ReverseWhois (sfp_reversewhois)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>ReverseWhois is a free search engine to find domain names owned by an individual or company.\nSearch based on names or email addresses.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.reversewhois.io/\" target=_new>https://www.reversewhois.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_ripe' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>RIPE (sfp_ripe)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>We're an independent, not-for-profit membership organisation that supports the infrastructure of the Internet through technical coordination in our service region. Our most prominent activity is to act as the Regional Internet Registry (RIR) providing global Internet resources and related services (IPv4, IPv6 and AS Number resources) to members in our service region.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.ripe.net/\" target=_new>https://www.ripe.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_robtex' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Robtex (sfp_robtex)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Robtex is used for various kinds of research of IP numbers, Domain names, etc\nRobtex uses various sources to gather public information about IP numbers, domain names, host names, Autonomous systems, routes etc. It then indexes the data in a big database and provide free access to the data.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.robtex.com/\" target=_new>https://www.robtex.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_robtex:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_robtex:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_robtex:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_robtex:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv6 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_robtex:maxv6netblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum IPv6 subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_robtex:maxv6subnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible co-hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_robtex:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_robtex:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_robtex:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_rocketchat' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Rocket.Chat Server Monitor (sfp_rocketchat)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Rocket.Chat access token.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketchat:access_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., message,join,leave).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketchat:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"message,join,leave\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per room.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketchat:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketchat:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Rocket.Chat room ID to monitor.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketchat:room_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Rocket.Chat server URL.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketchat:server_url' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Timestamp or token for incremental sync (empty for full history).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketchat:since' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_rocketreach' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>RocketReach (Official API) (sfp_rocketreach)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>RocketReach is a search engine for finding contact information of professionals.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://rocketreach.co/\" target=_new>https://rocketreach.co/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>RocketReach API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://rocketreach.co/'>https://rocketreach.co/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://rocketreach.co/api'>https://rocketreach.co/api</a></li><li>Your API key will be listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketreach:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between API requests (in seconds).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketreach:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of results to retrieve (respecting RocketReach API limits).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rocketreach:max_results' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_rubika' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Rubika Monitor (sfp_rubika)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Rubika channel IDs.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rubika:channel_ids' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per channel.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_rubika:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_s3bucket' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Amazon S3 Bucket Finder (sfp_s3bucket)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Amazon S3 is cloud object storage with industry-leading scalability, data availability, security, and performance. S3 is ideal for data lakes, mobile applications, backup and restore, archival, IoT devices, ML, AI, and analytics.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/s3/\" target=_new>https://aws.amazon.com/s3/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Different S3 endpoints to check where buckets may exist, as per http://docs.aws.amazon.com/general/latest/gr/rande.html#s3_region\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_s3bucket:endpoints' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"s3.amazonaws.com,s3-external-1.amazonaws.com,s3-us-west-1.amazonaws.com,s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com,s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com,s3-ap-south-1.amazonaws.com,s3.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com,s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com,s3-ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com,s3-ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com,s3-ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com,s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com,s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com,s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com,s3-sa-east-1.amazonaws.com\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>List of suffixes to append to domains tried as bucket names\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_s3bucket:suffixes' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"test,dev,web,beta,bucket,space,files,content,data,prod,staging,production,stage,app,media,development,-test,-dev,-web,-beta,-bucket,-space,-files,-content,-data,-prod,-staging,-production,-stage,-app,-media,-development\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_searchcode' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>searchcode (sfp_searchcode)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Simple, comprehensive code search.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://searchcode.com/\" target=_new>https://searchcode.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>DNS resolve each identified domain.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_searchcode:dns_resolve' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages of results to fetch.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_searchcode:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_securitytrails' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>SecurityTrails (sfp_securitytrails)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Data for Security companies, researchers and teams. Fast, always up API that allows you to access current and historical data. The API is paid via a simple pricing structure that allows you to embed our data into your applications.\nSearch nearly 3 billion historical and current WHOIS data and WHOIS changes.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://securitytrails.com/\" target=_new>https://securitytrails.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>SecurityTrails API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://securitytrails.com'>https://securitytrails.com</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://securitytrails.com/app/account/credentials'>https://securitytrails.com/app/account/credentials</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_securitytrails:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_securitytrails:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_securitytrails:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_securitytrails:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_seon' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Seon (sfp_seon)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>SEON Fraud Prevention tools help organisations reduce the costs and resources lost to fraud. Spot fake accounts, slash manual reviews and cut chargebacks now.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://seon.io/\" target=_new>https://seon.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>seon.io API Key\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://seon.io/'>https://seon.io/</a></li><li>Register an account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://docs.seon.io/api-reference'>https://docs.seon.io/api-reference</a></li><li>Your API key is listed under 'License key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_seon:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum fraud score for target to be marked as malicious (0-100)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_seon:fraud_threshold' class='form-control' type=text value=\"80\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_shodan' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>SHODAN (sfp_shodan)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Shodan is the world's first search engine for Internet-connected devices.\nUse Shodan to discover which of your devices are connected to the Internet, where they are located and who is using them.Keep track of all the computers on your network that are directly accessible from the Internet. Shodan lets you understand your digital footprint.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.shodan.io/\" target=_new>https://www.shodan.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>SHODAN API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://shodan.io'>https://shodan.io</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://account.shodan.io/'>https://account.shodan.io/</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_shodan:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_shodan:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_shodan:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_similar' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Similar Domain Finder (sfp_similar)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Skip TLDs and sub-TLDs that have wildcard DNS.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_similar:skipwildcards' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_skymem' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Skymem (sfp_skymem)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Find email addresses of companies and people.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://www.skymem.info/\" target=_new>http://www.skymem.info/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_slideshare' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>SlideShare (sfp_slideshare)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>LinkedIn SlideShare is an American hosting service for professional content including presentations, infographics, documents, and videos. Users can upload files privately or publicly in PowerPoint, Word, PDF, or OpenDocument format.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net\" target=_new>https://www.slideshare.net</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_snov' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Snov (sfp_snov)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Snov.io API allows to get a list of all emails from a particular domain, find email addresses by name and domain, verify emails, add prospects to a list, change a recipient's status and more.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://snov.io/\" target=_new>https://snov.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Snov.io API Client ID\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://snov.io'>https://snov.io</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://app.snov.io/api-setting'>https://app.snov.io/api-setting</a></li><li>The API key combination is listed under 'API User ID' and 'API Secret'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_snov:api_key_client_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Snov.io API Client Secret\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://snov.io'>https://snov.io</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://app.snov.io/api-setting'>https://app.snov.io/api-setting</a></li><li>The API key combination is listed under 'API User ID' and 'API Secret'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_snov:api_key_client_secret' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_social' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Social Network Identifier (sfp_social)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_sociallinks' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Social Links (sfp_sociallinks)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Social Links provides instruments for OSINT methods that are used by the world's leading investigation and law enforcement agencies</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://sociallinks.io/\" target=_new>https://sociallinks.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Social Links API Key\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://sociallinks.io/'>https://sociallinks.io/</a></li><li>Register an account</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_sociallinks:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_socialprofiles' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Social Media Profile Finder (sfp_socialprofiles)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Google Custom Search enables you to create a search engine for your website, your blog, or a collection of websites. You can configure your engine to search both web pages and images. You can fine-tune the ranking, add your own promotions and customize the look and feel of the search results. You can monetize the search by connecting your engine to your Google AdSense account.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow, apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/custom-search\" target=_new>https://developers.google.com/custom-search</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Bing API Key for social media profile search.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>If using Google:</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction'>https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction</a></li><li>Register a free Google account</li><li>Click on 'Get A Key'</li><li>Connect a Project</li><li>The API Key will be listed under 'YOUR API KEY'</li><li>If using Bing:</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/cognitive-services/bing-web-search-api/'>https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/cognitive-services/bing-web-search-api/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Select on Bing Custom Search</li><li>The API keys are listed under 'Key1' and 'Key2' (both should work)</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_socialprofiles:bing_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of bing search engine results of identified profiles to iterate through.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_socialprofiles:count' class='form-control' type=text value=\"20\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google API Key for social media profile search.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>If using Google:</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction'>https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction</a></li><li>Register a free Google account</li><li>Click on 'Get A Key'</li><li>Connect a Project</li><li>The API Key will be listed under 'YOUR API KEY'</li><li>If using Bing:</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/cognitive-services/bing-web-search-api/'>https://azure.microsoft.com/en-in/services/cognitive-services/bing-web-search-api/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Select on Bing Custom Search</li><li>The API keys are listed under 'Key1' and 'Key2' (both should work)</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_socialprofiles:google_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Google Custom Search Engine ID.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_socialprofiles:google_cse_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"013611106330597893267:tfgl3wxdtbp\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Search engine to use: 'google' or 'bing'.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_socialprofiles:method' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"bing\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Tighten results by expecting to find the keyword of the target domain mentioned in the social media profile page results?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_socialprofiles:tighten' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_sorbs' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>SORBS (sfp_sorbs)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The Spam and Open Relay Blocking System (SORBS) was conceived as an anti-spam project where a daemon would check \"on-the-fly\", all servers from which it received email to determine if that email was sent via various types of proxy and open-relay servers.\nThe SORBS (Spam and Open Relay Blocking System) provides free access to its DNS-based Block List (DNSBL) to effectively block email from more than 12 million host servers known to disseminate spam, phishing attacks and other forms of malicious email.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://www.sorbs.net/\" target=_new>http://www.sorbs.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_sorbs:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_sorbs:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_sorbs:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_sorbs:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_soroush' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Soroush Monitor (sfp_soroush)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Soroush channel IDs.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_soroush:channel_ids' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per channel.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_soroush:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_spamcop' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>SpamCop (sfp_spamcop)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>SpamCop is the premier service for reporting spam. SpamCop determines the origin of unwanted email and reports it to the relevant Internet service providers.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.spamcop.net/\" target=_new>https://www.spamcop.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spamcop:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spamcop:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spamcop:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spamcop:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_spamhaus' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Spamhaus Zen (sfp_spamhaus)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The Spamhaus Project is an international nonprofit organization that tracks spam and related cyber threats such as phishing, malware and botnets, provides realtime actionable and highly accurate threat intelligence to the Internet's major networks, corporations and security vendors, and works with law enforcement agencies to identify and pursue spam and malware sources worldwide. ZEN is the combination of all Spamhaus IP-based DNSBLs into one single powerful and comprehensive blocklist to make querying faster and simpler. It contains the SBL, SBLCSS, XBL and PBL blocklists.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.spamhaus.org/\" target=_new>https://www.spamhaus.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spamhaus:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spamhaus:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spamhaus:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spamhaus:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_spider' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Web Spider (sfp_spider)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>File extensions to ignore (don't fetch them.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spider:filterfiles' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"png,gif,jpg,jpeg,tiff,tif,tar,pdf,ico,flv,mp4,mp3,avi,mpg,gz,mpeg,iso,dat,mov,swf,rar,exe,zip,bin,bz2,xsl,doc,docx,ppt,pptx,xls,xlsx,csv\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>MIME types to ignore.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spider:filtermime' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"image/\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Skip spidering of /~user directories?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spider:filterusers' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum levels to traverse per starting point (e.g. hostname or link identified by another module) identified.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spider:maxlevels' class='form-control' type=text value=\"3\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages to fetch per starting point identified.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spider:maxpages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Skip spidering of subdomains of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spider:nosubs' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of seconds to pause between page fetches.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spider:pausesec' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report links every time one is found, even if found before?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spider:reportduplicates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Only follow links specified by robots.txt?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spider:robotsonly' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Prepend targets with these until you get a hit, to start spidering.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                \n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spider:start' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"http://,https://\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Accept and use cookies?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spider:usecookies' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_spur' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>spur.us (sfp_spur)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>We expose VPNs, residential proxies, botnets, anonymization behavior, geo-fraud, and more. Anonymous infrastructure has changed; it is time the security industry caught up.\nIdentify commercial and private VPN exit points along with the name of the service. We expose over 80 different commercial providers.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://spur.us/\" target=_new>https://spur.us/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>spur.us API Key\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://spur.us'>https://spur.us</a></li><li>Register an account</li><li>Pay for a subscription</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://spur.us/app/context/tokens'>https://spur.us/app/context/tokens</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'Token'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spur:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spur:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spur:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_spur:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spur:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_spur:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_sslcert' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>SSL Certificate Analyzer (sfp_sslcert)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of days in the future a certificate expires to consider it as expiring.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_sslcert:certexpiringdays' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Seconds before giving up trying to HTTPS connect.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_sslcert:ssltimeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Also try to HTTPS-connect to HTTP sites and hostnames.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_sslcert:tryhttp' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify certificate subject alternative names resolve.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_sslcert:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_stackoverflow' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>StackOverflow (sfp_stackoverflow)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>StackOverflow is a knowledge sharing public platform for IT professionalsand students where users can post questions and get answers from other users.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>errorprone, apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.stackexchange.com\" target=_new>https://www.stackexchange.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>StackApps has an optional API key. Using an API key will increase the amount of requests allowed.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://stackapps.com/apps/oauth/register'>https://stackapps.com/apps/oauth/register</a></li><li>Fill out the details in the form with as much details as you're comfortable with.</li><li>The OAuth Domain can either be a valid domain you own or control, or stackexchange.com.Select 'Register Your Application'.Under the Title 'Key' is your API key, use this for an increased request quota.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_stackoverflow:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_stevenblack_hosts' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Steven Black Hosts (sfp_stevenblack_hosts)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Consolidating and extending hosts files (for malware and adware)from several well-curated sources.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/StevenBlack/hosts\" target=_new>https://github.com/StevenBlack/hosts</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_stevenblack_hosts:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_stevenblack_hosts:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_stevenblack_hosts:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_strangeheaders' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Strange Header Identifier (sfp_strangeheaders)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_subdomain_takeover' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Subdomain Takeover Checker (sfp_subdomain_takeover)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_sublist3r' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Sublist3r PassiveDNS (sfp_sublist3r)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>This is the API queried by the Sublist3r tool.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://api.sublist3r.com\" target=_new>https://api.sublist3r.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_surbl' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>SURBL (sfp_surbl)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>SURBLs are lists of web sites that have appeared in unsolicited messages. Unlike most lists, SURBLs are not lists of message senders.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://www.surbl.org/\" target=_new>http://www.surbl.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_surbl:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_surbl:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_surbl:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_surbl:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_surbl:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_surbl:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_talosintel' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Talos Intelligence (sfp_talosintel)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Cisco Talos Incident Response provides a full suite of proactive and reactive services to help you prepare, respond and recover from a breach. With Talos IR, you have direct access to the same threat intelligence available to Cisco and world-class emergency response capabilities — in addition to more than 350 threat researchers for questions and analysis. Let our experts work with you to evaluate existing plans, develop a new plan, and provide rapid assistance when you need it most.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://talosintelligence.com/\" target=_new>https://talosintelligence.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_talosintel:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_talosintel:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_talosintel:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_talosintel:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_telegram' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Telegram Channel Monitor (sfp_telegram)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>security</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Telegram API Hash (get from https://my.telegram.org)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_telegram:api_hash' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Telegram API ID (get from https://my.telegram.org)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_telegram:api_id' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Telegram channel usernames (e.g. @channel1,@channel2)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_telegram:channels' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Only emit events for messages containing these keywords (comma-separated). Leave blank for all.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_telegram:filter_keywords' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per channel per poll.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_telegram:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated message types to emit: text,media,link.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_telegram:message_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"text\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Polling interval in seconds for checking new messages.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_telegram:poll_interval' class='form-control' type=text value=\"60\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated keyword:severity pairs (e.g. phishing:high,scam:medium) for tagging events.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_telegram:severity_keywords' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"phishing:high,malware:high,scam:medium\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_textmagic' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>TextMagic (sfp_textmagic)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>TextMagic is a business text-messaging service for sending notifications, alerts, reminders, confirmations and SMS marketing campaigns.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.textmagic.com/\" target=_new>https://www.textmagic.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>TextMagic API Key\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://textmagic.com'>https://textmagic.com</a></li><li>Register a free trial account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://my.textmagic.com/online/api/rest-api/keys'>https://my.textmagic.com/online/api/rest-api/keys</a></li><li>Click on 'Add new API Key'</li><li>Your API key will be listed beside 'The new API Key is'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_textmagic:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>TextMagic API Username\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://textmagic.com'>https://textmagic.com</a></li><li>Register a free trial account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://my.textmagic.com/online/api/rest-api/keys'>https://my.textmagic.com/online/api/rest-api/keys</a></li><li>Click on 'Add new API Key'</li><li>Your API key will be listed beside 'The new API Key is'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_textmagic:api_key_username' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_threatcrowd' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ThreatCrowd (sfp_threatcrowd)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The ThreatCrowd API allows you to quickly identify related infrastructure and malware.\nWith the ThreatCrowd API you can search for Domains, IP Addreses, E-mail adddresses, Filehashes, Antivirus detections.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.threatcrowd.org\" target=_new>https://www.threatcrowd.org</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_threatcrowd:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check co-hosted sites?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_threatcrowd:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_threatcrowd:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_threatcrowd:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_threatcrowd:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_threatcrowd:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_threatfox' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ThreatFox (sfp_threatfox)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>ThreatFox is a free platform from abuse.ch with the goal of sharingindicators of compromise (IOCs) associated with malware with the infosec community,AV vendors and threat intelligence providers.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://threatfox.abuse.ch\" target=_new>https://threatfox.abuse.ch</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_threatfox:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_threatminer' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ThreatMiner (sfp_threatminer)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>ThreatMiner is a threat intelligence portal designed to enable analysts to research under a single interface. It is used in the SANS FOR578 Cyber Threat Intelligence course.\nThreat intelligence and intrusion analysts who regularly perform research into malware and network infrastructure often find the need to rely on mutliple websites that individually holds a small piece of the larger puzzle.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.threatminer.org/\" target=_new>https://www.threatminer.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore records older than this many days. 0 = Unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_threatminer:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"90\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_threatminer:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_threatminer:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_threatminer:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_threatminer:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_threatminer:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify that any hostnames found on the target domain still resolve?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_threatminer:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tiktok_osint' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>TikTok OSINT Intelligence (sfp_tiktok_osint)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>TikTok OSINT intelligence gathering module.<br/><br/>TikTok is a short-form video hosting service. This module extracts user profiles, content metadata, and performs network analysis for OSINT purposes.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com\" target=_new>https://www.tiktok.com</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Analyze comments on videos for additional intelligence\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tiktok_osint:analyze_comments' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>TikTok API Client Key (optional for web scraping)\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://developers.tiktok.com/'>https://developers.tiktok.com/</a></li><li>Create a developer account</li><li>Register your application</li><li>Copy the Client Key and Client Secret</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tiktok_osint:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>TikTok API Client Secret (optional for web scraping)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tiktok_osint:api_secret' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Perform detailed content analysis\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tiktok_osint:content_analysis' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Extract and analyze hashtags from content\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tiktok_osint:extract_hashtags' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of videos to analyze per user\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tiktok_osint:max_videos_per_user' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Perform network analysis of followers/following\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tiktok_osint:network_analysis' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests to avoid rate limiting (seconds)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tiktok_osint:rate_limit_delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Respect robots.txt restrictions\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tiktok_osint:respect_robots_txt' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Use web scraping when API is not available\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tiktok_osint:use_web_scraping' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tldsearch' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>TLD Searcher (sfp_tldsearch)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Only report domains that have content (try to fetch the page)?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tldsearch:activeonly' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Skip TLDs and sub-TLDs that have wildcard DNS.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tldsearch:skipwildcards' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_cmseek' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - CMSeeK (sfp_tool_cmseek)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the where the cmseek.py file lives. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_cmseek:cmseekpath' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to Python 3 interpreter to use for CMSeeK. If just 'python3' then it must be in your PATH.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_cmseek:pythonpath' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"python3\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_dnstwist' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - DNSTwist (sfp_tool_dnstwist)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>DNS</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the where the dnstwist.py file lives. Optional.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_dnstwist:dnstwistpath' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to Python interpreter to use for DNSTwist. If just 'python' then it must be in your PATH.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_dnstwist:pythonpath' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"python\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Skip TLDs and sub-TLDs that have wildcard DNS.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_dnstwist:skipwildcards' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_gobuster' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tools - Gobuster (sfp_tool_gobuster)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool, slow, invasive</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of file extensions to look for (gobuster -x).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:extensions' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"php,asp,aspx,jsp,html,htm,js\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Follow redirects (gobuster -r)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_gobuster:follow_redirects' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the gobuster binary. If just 'gobuster' then assume it's in the system path.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:gobuster_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable remote execution via SSH (true/false)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_gobuster:remote_enabled' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH host (IP or hostname)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:remote_host' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH password (optional if using key)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:remote_password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>(Deprecated) Path to SSH private key (use remote_ssh_key_data instead)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:remote_ssh_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Paste your SSH private key here (PEM format, multi-line)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:remote_ssh_key_data' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Extra arguments/config for the tool on the remote machine\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:remote_tool_args' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the tool on the remote machine\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:remote_tool_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH username\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:remote_user' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of status codes to consider valid (gobuster -s).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:status_codes' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"200,204,301,302,307,401,403\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of concurrent threads (gobuster -t).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:threads' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Timeout in seconds for gobuster requests (gobuster -to).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Use the configured SpiderFoot proxy for scanning.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_gobuster:use_proxy' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the wordlist used for brute-forcing.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_gobuster:wordlist' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_nbtscan' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - nbtscan (sfp_tool_nbtscan)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool, slow</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>The path to your nbtscan binary\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nbtscan:nbtscan_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Scan all IPs within identified owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_nbtscan:netblockscan' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum netblock/subnet size to scan IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nbtscan:netblockscanmax' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_nmap' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - Nmap (sfp_tool_nmap)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool, slow, invasive</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Port scan all IPs within identified owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_nmap:netblockscan' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum netblock/subnet size to scan IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:netblockscanmax' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the where the nmap binary lives. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:nmappath' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable remote execution via SSH (true/false)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_nmap:remote_enabled' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH host (IP or hostname)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:remote_host' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH password (optional if using key)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:remote_password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>(Deprecated) Path to SSH private key (use remote_ssh_key_data instead)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:remote_ssh_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Paste your SSH private key here (PEM format, multi-line)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:remote_ssh_key_data' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Extra arguments/config for the tool on the remote machine\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:remote_tool_args' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the tool on the remote machine\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:remote_tool_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH username\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nmap:remote_user' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_nuclei' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - Nuclei (sfp_tool_nuclei)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool, slow, invasive</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check all IPs within identified owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_nuclei:netblockscan' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum netblock/subnet size to scan IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:netblockscanmax' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The path to your nuclei binary. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:nuclei_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable remote execution via SSH (true/false)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_nuclei:remote_enabled' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH host (IP or hostname)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:remote_host' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH password (optional if using key)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:remote_password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>(Deprecated) Path to SSH private key (use remote_ssh_key_data instead)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:remote_ssh_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Paste your SSH private key here (PEM format, multi-line)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:remote_ssh_key_data' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Extra arguments/config for the tool on the remote machine\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:remote_tool_args' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the tool on the remote machine\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:remote_tool_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH username\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:remote_user' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The path to your nuclei templates. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_nuclei:template_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_onesixtyone' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - onesixtyone (sfp_tool_onesixtyone)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of SNMP communities to try.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_onesixtyone:communities' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1234,2read,4changes,CISCO,IBM,OrigEquipMfr,SNMP,SUN,access,admin,agent,all,cisco,community,default,enable,field,guest,hello,ibm,manager,mngt,monitor,netman,network,none,openview,pass,password,private,proxy,public,read,read-only,read-write,root,router,secret,security,snmp,snmpd,solaris,sun,switch,system,tech,test,world,write\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Scan all IPs within identified owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_onesixtyone:netblockscan' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum netblock/subnet size to scan IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_onesixtyone:netblockscanmax' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>The path to your onesixtyone binary. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_onesixtyone:onesixtyone_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_phoneinfoga' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tools - PhoneInfoga (sfp_tool_phoneinfoga)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool, invasive, apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>PhoneInfoga API endpoint (default: http://localhost:5000/api/v2/scan)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:api_endpoint' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"http://localhost:5000/api/v2/scan\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>API key for PhoneInfoga (if required, sent as X-Api-Key header)\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>See <a target=_new href='https://github.com/sundowndev/phoneinfoga'>https://github.com/sundowndev/phoneinfoga</a> for API key setup instructions.</li><li>Enter your API key in the module options.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable remote execution via SSH (true/false)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:remote_enabled' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH host (IP or hostname)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:remote_host' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH password (optional if using key)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:remote_password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>(Deprecated) Path to SSH private key (use remote_ssh_key_data instead)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:remote_ssh_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Paste your SSH private key here (PEM format, multi-line)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:remote_ssh_key_data' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Extra arguments/config for the tool on the remote machine\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:remote_tool_args' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the tool on the remote machine\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:remote_tool_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Remote SSH username\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:remote_user' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of times to retry the API call on failure.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:retries' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Seconds to wait between retries.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:retry_delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"2\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Timeout in seconds for API requests.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_phoneinfoga:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"15\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_retirejs' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - Retire.js (sfp_tool_retirejs)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to your retire binary. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_retirejs:retirejs_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_snallygaster' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - snallygaster (sfp_tool_snallygaster)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to your snallygaster binary. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_snallygaster:snallygaster_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_testsslsh' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - testssl.sh (sfp_tool_testsslsh)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Only report CVEs equal to or higher than this level, must be either LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH or CRITICAL.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_testsslsh:mincve' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"LOW\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Test all IPs within identified owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_testsslsh:netblockscan' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum netblock/subnet size to test IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_testsslsh:netblockscanmax' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to your testssl.sh executable. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_testsslsh:testsslsh_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_trufflehog' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - TruffleHog (sfp_tool_trufflehog)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool, slow</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Search all code repositories found. By default TruffleHog only searches those linked from the target website.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_trufflehog:allrepos' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Enable entropy checks? If disabled, TruffleHog will solely rely on high-signal regular expressions to identify secrets.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_tool_trufflehog:entropy' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to your trufflehog binary. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_trufflehog:trufflehog_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_wafw00f' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - WAFW00F (sfp_tool_wafw00f)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Crawling and Scanning</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to Python 3 interpreter to use for wafw00f. If just 'python3' then it must be in your $PATH.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_wafw00f:python_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"python3\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the wafw00f executable file. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_wafw00f:wafw00f_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_wappalyzer' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - Wappalyzer (API) (sfp_tool_wappalyzer)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool, apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Your Wappalyzer API key (required). Get one at https://www.wappalyzer.com/api/.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Sign up at <a target=_new href='https://www.wappalyzer.com/api/'>https://www.wappalyzer.com/api/</a> to obtain an API key.</li><li>Enter your API key in the module options.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_wappalyzer:wappalyzer_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Wappalyzer API endpoint (default should be fine).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_wappalyzer:wappalyzer_api_url' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"https://api.wappalyzer.com/v2/lookup/\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tool_whatweb' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tool - WhatWeb (sfp_tool_whatweb)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>tool</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Set WhatWeb aggression level (1-4)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_whatweb:aggression' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Path to the whatweb executable file. Must be set.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tool_whatweb:whatweb_path' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_torch' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>TORCH (sfp_torch)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Torch or TorSearch is the best search engine for the hidden part of the internet. They're also the oldest and longest running search engine on Tor.\nTorch claims to have over one billion dark net pages indexed. They also don't censor search results or track what you search for.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>errorprone, tor</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://torchsearch.wordpress.com/\" target=_new>https://torchsearch.wordpress.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Fetch the darknet pages (via TOR, if enabled) to verify they mention your target.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_torch:fetchlinks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Search for human names?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_torch:fullnames' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Number of results pages to iterate through.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_torch:pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"20\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_torexits' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>TOR Exit Nodes (sfp_torexits)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The relay search tool displays data about single relays and bridges in the Tor network.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Secondary Networks</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://metrics.torproject.org/\" target=_new>https://metrics.torproject.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_torexits:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_torexits:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_torexits:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_tron' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Tron Blockchain Monitor (sfp_tron)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Tron addresses.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tron:addresses' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>TronGrid API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Register at <a target=_new href='https://www.trongrid.io/'>https://www.trongrid.io/</a></li><li>Get your API key and paste it into the module configuration.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tron:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>End block number for filtering transactions (0 for latest).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tron:end_block' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of event types to include (e.g., transfer,contract).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tron:event_types' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"transfer,contract\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of transactions to fetch per address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tron:max_transactions' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Minimum transaction value (TRX) to include.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tron:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Start block number for filtering transactions (0 for earliest).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_tron:start_block' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_trumail' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Trumail (sfp_trumail)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Trumail is a product that was built with the intention of providing an easy to use API to software professionals who value a quality audience. Your apps registration workflow is one of the most important and complex parts of your software and it's very important that you filter user credentials in a way that allows for future use. Invalid user credentials, particularly email addresses, should be deemed valid and deliverable at the time of signup - That's where we come in.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://trumail.io/\" target=_new>https://trumail.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_twilio' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Twilio (sfp_twilio)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Twilio is a cloud communications platform as a service company based in San Francisco, California. Twilio allows software developers to programmatically make and receive phone calls, send and receive text messages, and perform other communication functions using its web service APIs.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.twilio.com/\" target=_new>https://www.twilio.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Twilio Account SID\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.twilio.com'>https://www.twilio.com</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://www.twilio.com/console'>https://www.twilio.com/console</a></li><li>The API key combination is listed under 'Account SID' and 'Auth Token'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_twilio:api_key_account_sid' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Twilio Auth Token\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.twilio.com'>https://www.twilio.com</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://www.twilio.com/console'>https://www.twilio.com/console</a></li><li>The API key combination is listed under 'Account SID' and 'Auth Token'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_twilio:api_key_auth_token' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_twitter' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Twitter (sfp_twitter)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Twitter is an American microblogging and social networking service on which users post and interact with messages known as \"tweets\". Registered users can post, like, and retweet tweets, but unregistered users can only read them.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://twitter.com/\" target=_new>https://twitter.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_uceprotect' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>UCEPROTECT (sfp_uceprotect)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>UCEPROTECT is a DNS blacklisting service whose mission is to stop mail abuse globally.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://www.uceprotect.net/\" target=_new>http://www.uceprotect.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_uceprotect:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_uceprotect:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_uceprotect:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_uceprotect:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_unwiredlabs' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>UnwiredLabs Geolocation API (sfp_unwiredlabs)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Real World</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>UnwiredLabs API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Register at <a target=_new href='https://unwiredlabs.com/'>https://unwiredlabs.com/</a></li><li>Get your API key and paste it into the module configuration.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_unwiredlabs:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>City to filter results.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_unwiredlabs:city' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Country to filter results.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_unwiredlabs:country' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of results to return.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_unwiredlabs:max_results' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_unwiredlabs:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Type of search: ip, wifi, or cell.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_unwiredlabs:search_type' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"ip\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Value to search for (IP address, WiFi MAC, or cell info).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_unwiredlabs:search_value' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_urlscan' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>URLScan.io (sfp_urlscan)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>urlscan.io is a service to scan and analyse websites. When a URL is submitted to urlscan.io, an automated process will browse to the URL like a regular user and record the activity that this page navigation creates. This includes the domains and IPs contacted, the resources (JavaScript, CSS, etc) requested from those domains, as well as additional information about the page itself. urlscan.io will take a screenshot of the page, record the DOM content, JavaScript global variables, cookies created by the page, and a myriad of other observations.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://urlscan.io/\" target=_new>https://urlscan.io/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify that any hostnames found on the target domain still resolve?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_urlscan:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_venmo' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Venmo (sfp_venmo)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Venmo is a digital wallet that allows you to send money and make purchases at approved merchants.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://venmo.com/\" target=_new>https://venmo.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_viewdns' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ViewDNS.info (sfp_viewdns)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>The ViewDNS.info API allows webmasters to integrate the tools provided by ViewDNS.info into their own sites in a simple and effective manner.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://viewdns.info/\" target=_new>https://viewdns.info/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>ViewDNS.info API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://viewdns.info/api'>https://viewdns.info/api</a></li><li>Select a plan</li><li>Register an account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://viewdns.info/api/dashboard/'>https://viewdns.info/api/dashboard/</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_viewdns:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_viewdns:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_viewdns:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_virustotal' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>VirusTotal (sfp_virustotal)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Analyze suspicious files and URLs to detect types of malware, automatically share them with the security community.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.virustotal.com/\" target=_new>https://www.virustotal.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>VirusTotal API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.virustotal.com/'>https://www.virustotal.com/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Click on your profile</li><li>Click on API Key</li><li>The API key is listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_virustotal:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_virustotal:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check co-hosted sites?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_virustotal:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_virustotal:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_virustotal:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_virustotal:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Are you using a public key? If so SpiderFoot will pause for 15 seconds after each query to avoid VirusTotal dropping requests.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_virustotal:publicapi' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_virustotal:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify that any hostnames found on the target domain still resolve?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_virustotal:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_voipbl' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>VoIP Blacklist (VoIPBL) (sfp_voipbl)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>VoIPBL is a distributed VoIP blacklist that is aimed to protect against\nVoIP Fraud and minimizing abuse for network that have publicly accessible PBXs.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://voipbl.org/\" target=_new>https://voipbl.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_voipbl:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_voipbl:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Report if any malicious IPs are found within owned netblocks?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_voipbl:checknetblocks' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check if any malicious IPs are found within the same subnet of the target?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_voipbl:checksubnets' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_vxvault' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>VXVault.net (sfp_vxvault)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>VxVault is a malware management program to automatically download and classify malware samples. VxVault downloads malware samples from links from online sources such as webpages or RSS feeds, downloads them and attempts to identify the malware using VirusTotal. It then sort the malware onto a local file system and into a SQLite database.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"http://vxvault.net/\" target=_new>http://vxvault.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Hours to cache list data before re-fetching.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_vxvault:cacheperiod' class='form-control' type=text value=\"18\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_vxvault:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to sites found to be co-hosted on the target's IP?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_vxvault:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_webanalytics' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Web Analytics Extractor (sfp_webanalytics)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_webframework' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Web Framework Identifier (sfp_webframework)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_webserver' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Web Server Identifier (sfp_webserver)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_wechat' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>WeChat Monitor (sfp_wechat)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>WeChat API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Register for WeChat API access at <a target=_new href='https://open.weixin.qq.com/'>https://open.weixin.qq.com/</a></li><li>Get your API credentials and paste them into the module configuration.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wechat:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per user.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wechat:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of WeChat user IDs.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wechat:user_ids' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_whatcms' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>WhatCMS (sfp_whatcms)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Detect what CMS a site is using.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Content Analysis</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey, slow</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://whatcms.org/\" target=_new>https://whatcms.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>WhatCMS API key\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://whatcms.org/API'>https://whatcms.org/API</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://whatcms.org/APIKey'>https://whatcms.org/APIKey</a></li><li>The API key is listed under 'Your API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whatcms:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whatcms:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Query timeout, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whatcms:timeout' class='form-control' type=text value=\"25\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_whatsapp' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>WhatsApp Monitor (sfp_whatsapp)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>WhatsApp Business API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Apply for WhatsApp Business API access at <a target=_new href='https://www.twilio.com/whatsapp'>https://www.twilio.com/whatsapp</a> or Meta.</li><li>Get your API credentials and paste them into the module configuration.</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whatsapp:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of messages to fetch per number.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whatsapp:max_messages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of WhatsApp phone numbers.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whatsapp:phone_numbers' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_whois' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Whois (sfp_whois)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_whoisfreaks' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>WhoisFreaks (sfp_whoisfreaks)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Search domain names by owner email or name or company name through our Reverse WHOIS lookup API</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>slow, apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://whoisfreaks.com/\" target=_new>https://whoisfreaks.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>WhoisFreaks account registered API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://whoisfreaks.com/signup.html'>https://whoisfreaks.com/signup.html</a></li><li>Register an account.</li><li>The API key will be available on billing dashboard after signup</li><li>500 Free credits upon signup</li><li>select a plan to request beyond this limit</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://whoisfreaks.com/pricing/api-plans.html'>https://whoisfreaks.com/pricing/api-plans.html</a></li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whoisfreaks:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_whoisology' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Whoisology (sfp_whoisology)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Whoisology is a domain name ownership archive with literally billions of searchable and cross referenced domain name whois records.\nOur main focus is reverse whois which is used for cyber crime investigation / InfoSec, corporate intelligence, legal research, business development, and for good ol' fashioned poking around.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://whoisology.com/\" target=_new>https://whoisology.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Whoisology.com API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://whoisology.com/'>https://whoisology.com/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://whoisology.com/account'>https://whoisology.com/account</a></li><li>Click on API Access</li><li>Pay for Access and receive the API Key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whoisology:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_whoxy' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Whoxy (sfp_whoxy)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Whois API is a hosted web service that returns well-parsed WHOIS fields to your application in popular XML & JSON formats per HTTP request. Leave all the hard work to us, as you need not worry about the query limit and restrictions imposed by various domain registrars.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.whoxy.com/\" target=_new>https://www.whoxy.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Whoxy.com API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.whoxy.com/pricing.php'>https://www.whoxy.com/pricing.php</a></li><li>Select a plan and register an account</li><li>Pay for the plan</li><li>The API key will be presented upon payment</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_whoxy:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_wificafespots' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>WiFiCafeSpots.com Lookup (sfp_wificafespots)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>City to filter results.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wificafespots:city' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Country to filter results.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wificafespots:country' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of hotspots to return.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wificafespots:max_results' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wificafespots:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Term to search for (SSID, city, country, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wificafespots:search_term' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_wifimapio' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>WiFiMap.io Lookup (sfp_wifimapio)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Public Registries</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>City to filter results.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wifimapio:city' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Country to filter results.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wifimapio:country' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of hotspots to return.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wifimapio:max_results' class='form-control' type=text value=\"50\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Output format: summary (default) or full.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wifimapio:output_format' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"summary\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Term to search for (SSID, city, country, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wifimapio:search_term' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_wigle' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>WiGLE (sfp_wigle)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>We consolidate location and information of wireless networks world-wide to a central database, and have user-friendly desktop and web applications that can map, query and update the database via the web.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Secondary Networks</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://wigle.net/\" target=_new>https://wigle.net/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Wigle.net base64-encoded API name/token pair.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://wigle.net/'>https://wigle.net/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://wigle.net/account'>https://wigle.net/account</a></li><li>Click on 'Show my token'</li><li>The encoded API key is adjacent to 'Encoded for use'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wigle:api_key_encoded' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum age of data to be considered valid.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wigle:days_limit' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"365\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>How tightly to bound queries against the latitude/longitude box extracted from idenified addresses. This value must be between 0.001 and 0.2.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wigle:variance' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"0.01\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_wikileaks' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Wikileaks (sfp_wikileaks)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>WikiLeaks specializes in the analysis and publication of large datasets of censored or otherwise restricted official materials involving war, spying and corruption. It has so far published more than 10 million documents and associated analyses.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://wikileaks.org/\" target=_new>https://wikileaks.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>How many days back to consider a leak valid for capturing. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wikileaks:daysback' class='form-control' type=text value=\"365\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Include external leak sources such as Associated Twitter accounts, Snowden + Hammond Documents, Cryptome Documents, ICWatch, This Day in WikiLeaks Blog and WikiLeaks Press, WL Central.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_wikileaks:external' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_wikipediaedits' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Wikipedia Edits (sfp_wikipediaedits)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Wikipedia is a multilingual online encyclopedia created and maintained as an open collaboration project by a community of volunteer editors, using a wiki-based editing system.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Secondary Networks</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.wikipedia.org/\" target=_new>https://www.wikipedia.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum age of data to be considered valid (0 = unlimited).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_wikipediaedits:days_limit' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"365\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_xforce' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>XForce Exchange (sfp_xforce)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>IBM® X-Force Exchange is a cloud-based, threat intelligence sharing platform that you can use to rapidly research the latest global security threats, aggregate actionable intelligence, consult with experts and collaborate with peers. IBM X-Force Exchange, supported by human- and machine-generated intelligence, leverages the scale of IBM X-Force to help users stay ahead of emerging threats.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/\" target=_new>https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Ignore any records older than this many days. 0 = unlimited.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xforce:age_limit_days' class='form-control' type=text value=\"30\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Apply checks to affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_xforce:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Treat co-hosted sites on the same target domain as co-hosting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_xforce:cohostsamedomain' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 >True</option>\n                    <option value=0 selected>False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stop reporting co-hosted sites after this many are found, as it would likely indicate web hosting.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xforce:maxcohost' class='form-control' type=text value=\"100\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xforce:maxnetblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xforce:maxsubnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"24\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up owned netblocks, the maximum IPv6 netblock size to look up all IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xforce:maxv6netblock' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>If looking up subnets, the maximum IPv6 subnet size to look up all the IPs within (CIDR value, 24 = /24, 16 = /16, etc.)\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xforce:maxv6subnet' class='form-control' type=text value=\"120\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on netblocks deemed to be owned by your target for possible blacklisted hosts on the same target subdomain/domain?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_xforce:netblocklookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Look up all IPs on subnets which your target is a part of for blacklisting?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_xforce:subnetlookup' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify co-hosts are valid by checking if they still resolve to the shared IP.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_xforce:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>X-Force Exchange API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com'>https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/settings'>https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/settings</a></li><li>Click on 'API Access'</li><li>Provide an API name, and click 'Generate'</li><li>The API key combination is listed under 'API Key' and 'API Password'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xforce:xforce_api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>X-Force Exchange API Password.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com'>https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/settings'>https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/settings</a></li><li>Click on 'API Access'</li><li>Provide an API name, and click 'Generate'</li><li>The API key combination is listed under 'API Key' and 'API Password'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xforce:xforce_api_key_password' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_xiaohongshu' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Xiaohongshu (Little Red Book) Monitor (sfp_xiaohongshu)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/></td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Social Media</td><tr>\n\n\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of posts to fetch per user.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xiaohongshu:max_posts' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Comma-separated list of Xiaohongshu usernames.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_xiaohongshu:usernames' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_yandexdns' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Yandex DNS (sfp_yandexdns)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Yandex.DNS is a free, recursive DNS service. Yandex.DNS' servers are located in Russia, CIS countries, and Western Europe.In \"Basic\" mode, there is no traffic filtering. In \"Safe\" mode, protection from infected and fraudulent sites is provided. \"Family\" mode enables protection from dangerous sites and blocks sites with adult content.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Reputation Systems</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://yandex.com/\" target=_new>https://yandex.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_zetalytics' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Zetalytics (sfp_zetalytics)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Zetalytics database provides several useful endpoints to perform passive DNS analysis</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://zetalytics.com/\" target=_new>https://zetalytics.com/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Zetalytics API Key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://mailchi.mp/zetalytics/trial-access-request'>https://mailchi.mp/zetalytics/trial-access-request</a></li><li>Register a free account and request an API key</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_zetalytics:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify that any hostnames found on the target domain still resolve?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_zetalytics:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_zonefiles' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ZoneFile.io (sfp_zonefiles)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>You can fetch data for any domain name with our pay-as-you-go API.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Passive DNS</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://zonefiles.io\" target=_new>https://zonefiles.io</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>ZoneFiles.io API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://zonefiles.io'>https://zonefiles.io</a></li><li>Register an account</li><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://zonefiles.io/profile/'>https://zonefiles.io/profile/</a></li><li>The API key is listed next to 'Your API token'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_zonefiles:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between requests, in seconds.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_zonefiles:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Verify specified domains still resolve to the identified IP address.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_zonefiles:verify' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_zoneh' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>Zone-H Defacement Check (sfp_zoneh)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>Once a defaced website is submitted to Zone-H, it is mirrored on the Zone-H servers. The website is then moderated by the Zone-H staff to check if the defacement was fake. Sometimes, the hackers themselves submit their hacked pages to the site.\nIt is an Internet security portal containing original IT security news, digital warfare news, geopolitics, proprietary and general advisories, analyses, forums, researches. Zone-H is the largest web intrusions archive. It is published in several languages.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Leaks, Dumps and Breaches</td><tr>\n\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://zone-h.org/\" target=_new>https://zone-h.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check affiliates?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_zoneh:checkaffiliates' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Check co-hosted sites?\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n            \n                <select id='sfp_zoneh:checkcohosts' class='form-control'>\n                    <option value=1 selected>True</option>\n                    <option value=0 >False</option>                </select>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div id='optsect_sfp_zoomeye' class=\"tab-pane\" style=\"display: none\">\n    <h4>ZoomEye (sfp_zoomeye)</h4>\n\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Summary</td><td>No summary available.<br/><br/>ZoomEye is a search engine for cyberspace that lets researchers find specific network components, such as routers, servers, and IoT devices.</td></tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Categories:</td><td>Search Engines</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Tags:</td><td>apikey</td><tr>\n\n    <tr><td>Website:</td><td><a href=\"https://www.zoomeye.org/\" target=_new>https://www.zoomeye.org/</a></td></tr>\n\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h4>Settings</h4>\n    <table class='table table-bordered table-striped'>\n    <thead><tr><th>Option</th> <th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td>ZoomEye API key.\n                        \n                        &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href='#' data-html=\"true\" data-toggle=\"popover\" data-trigger=\"focus\" title=\"Instructions\" data-content=\"<ol><li>Visit <a target=_new href='https://www.zoomeye.org/'>https://www.zoomeye.org/</a></li><li>Register a free account</li><li>Navigate to <a target=_new href='https://www.zoomeye.org/profile'>https://www.zoomeye.org/profile</a></li><li>Your API key will be listed under 'API Key'</li></ol>\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-question-sign\"></i></a>\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_zoomeye:api_key' style='width: 500px' class='form-control' type=text value=\"\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Delay between API requests (in seconds).\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_zoomeye:delay' class='form-control' type=text value=\"1\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Maximum number of pages to iterate through, to avoid exceeding ZoomEye API usage limits.\n              </td>\n              <td style='vertical-align: middle'>\n                <div class='form-group'>\n                    <input id='sfp_zoomeye:max_pages' class='form-control' type=text value=\"10\">\n                </div>\n\n            </td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n    </table>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div> <!-- /tabbable tabs-left -->\n</form>\n<br><br>\n    </div>\n    <footer class=\"navbar-default navbar-fixed-bottom\">\n      <div class=\"container-fluid text-center footer\">\n        \n        <span><i class='glyphicon glyphicon-heart'></i>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a target=_new href='https://discord.gg/vyvztrG'>Join the SpiderFoot community Discord!</a></span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 0.85em;\">| Build: 20251101t033207-3d4ebc85</span>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    </body>\n</html>\n\n"
          },
